560>>>>>>>>>>>
560>>>>>>>>>>>// Wrapper for calling this function with separate x and y
560>>>>>>>>>>>Function WindowFromPoint Global Integer ixPos Integer iyPos Returns Handle
562>>>>>>>>>>>    Handle hWindow
562>>>>>>>>>>>    
562>>>>>>>>>>>    BigInt iWinPoint
562>>>>>>>>>>>    Move iyPos to iWinPoint
563>>>>>>>>>>>    Move ((iWinPoint * 65536 * 65536) + ixPos) to iWinPoint     // folded 64-bit integer
564>>>>>>>>>>>    Move (WinWindowFromPoint(iWinPoint)) to hWindow
565>>>>>>>>>>>    
565>>>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return hWindow
566>>>>>>>>>>>End_Function
