915>>>>>>>>>//    Get currency symbol from Windows, stop any "." from symbol
915>>>>>>>>>Function Default_Currency_Symbol Global Returns String
917>>>>>>>>>    WString sCurrency
917>>>>>>>>>    Pointer lpCurrency
917>>>>>>>>>    Integer iVal
917>>>>>>>>>    Move (Repeat(character(0),20)) to sCurrency
918>>>>>>>>>    Move (AddressOf(sCurrency)) to lpCurrency
919>>>>>>>>>    Move (GetLocaleInfoW(LOCALE_USER_DEFAULT,LOCALE_SCURRENCY,lpCurrency,20)) to iVal
920>>>>>>>>>    // currently our currency symbols do not handle periods ".", they should not
920>>>>>>>>>    // be used in currency symbols. We will strip any periods that came through the
920>>>>>>>>>    // windows currency symbol. This way the symbol will always be valid for VDF
920>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return (replaces(".", CString(sCurrency), ""))
921>>>>>>>>>End_Function
