998>>>>>>>>>// Does an alternte clock style Mod() operation. Modulo vs. Dividend
998>>>>>>>>>// This is only different from Mod when iNum is negative.
998>>>>>>>>>// Mod(-1,6) returns -1
998>>>>>>>>>// ModAlt(-1,6) returns 5
998>>>>>>>>>//
998>>>>>>>>>Function ModAlt Global BigInt iNum BigInt iDivisor Returns Integer
1000>>>>>>>>>    Integer iRet
1000>>>>>>>>>    Move (Mod(iNum,iDivisor)) to iRet
1001>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return (If(iRet<0, iRet + Abs(iDivisor), iRet))
