1003>>>>>>>>>//
1003>>>>>>>>>// Splits a string into an array of strings using the given delimiter.
1003>>>>>>>>>//
1003>>>>>>>>>// Params:
1003>>>>>>>>>//     sString     The string to split.
1003>>>>>>>>>//     sDel        The delimiter (like "," or "|")
1003>>>>>>>>>// Returns:
1003>>>>>>>>>//     Array of strings (not including the delimiters itself.
1003>>>>>>>>>Function StrSplitToArray Global String sString String sDel Returns String[]
1005>>>>>>>>>    String[] asResult
1006>>>>>>>>>    Integer iStart iEnd iDel
1006>>>>>>>>>    
1006>>>>>>>>>    If (sString <> "") Begin
1008>>>>>>>>>        
1008>>>>>>>>>        Move 1 to iStart
1009>>>>>>>>>        
1009>>>>>>>>>        Move (Length(sDel)) to iDel
1010>>>>>>>>>        Move (Pos(sDel, sString, iStart)) to iEnd
1011>>>>>>>>>        
1011>>>>>>>>>        If (iEnd > 0) Begin
1013>>>>>>>>>            While (iEnd > 0)
1017>>>>>>>>>                Move (Mid(sString,  iEnd - iStart, iStart)) to asResult[SizeOfArray(asResult)]
1018>>>>>>>>>                
1018>>>>>>>>>                Move (iEnd + iDel) to iStart
1019>>>>>>>>>                Move (Pos(sDel, sString, iStart)) to iEnd
1020>>>>>>>>>            Loop
1021>>>>>>>>>>
1021>>>>>>>>>            
1021>>>>>>>>>            Move (Right(sString,  Length(sString) - iStart + 1)) to asResult[SizeOfArray(asResult)]
1022>>>>>>>>>        End
1022>>>>>>>>>>
1022>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1023>>>>>>>>>            Move sString to asResult[0]
1024>>>>>>>>>        End
1024>>>>>>>>>>
1024>>>>>>>>>    End
1024>>>>>>>>>>
1024>>>>>>>>>    
1024>>>>>>>>>    
1024>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return asResult
1025>>>>>>>>>End_Function
1026>>>>>>>>>
1026>>>>>>>>>
1026>>>>>>>>>//
1026>>>>>>>>>//  Joins an array of strings into a single string delimited by the provided separator.
1026>>>>>>>>>//
1026>>>>>>>>>//  Params:
1026>>>>>>>>>//      aStr        Array of strings.
1026>>>>>>>>>//      sDel        Delimiter string.
1026>>>>>>>>>//  Returns:
1026>>>>>>>>>//      Strings joined into single string.
1026>>>>>>>>>//
1026>>>>>>>>>Function StrJoinFromArray Global String[] aStr String sDel Returns String
1028>>>>>>>>>    Integer i iTo
1028>>>>>>>>>    String sResult sValue
1028>>>>>>>>>    
1028>>>>>>>>>    Move (SizeOfArray(aStr) - 1) to iTo
1029>>>>>>>>>    For i from 0 to iTo
1035>>>>>>>>>>
1035>>>>>>>>>        If (i > 0) Begin
1037>>>>>>>>>            Move aStr[i] to sValue  //  Move to string value first to enforce proper conversion might someone pass a different type of array
1038>>>>>>>>>            Move (sResult + sDel + sValue) to sResult
1039>>>>>>>>>        End
1039>>>>>>>>>>
1039>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
1040>>>>>>>>>            Move aStr[i] to sResult
1041>>>>>>>>>        End
1041>>>>>>>>>>
1041>>>>>>>>>    Loop
1042>>>>>>>>>>
1042>>>>>>>>>    
1042>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return sResult
1043>>>>>>>>>End_Function
