1635>>>>>>>Use DDValtbl.pkg  // validation table classes
Including file: Ddvaltbl.pkg    (C:\Program Files\DataFlex 26.0\Pkg\Ddvaltbl.pkg)
1635>>>>>>>>>//  Validation Table Support for Extended Data-Sets. Fields may
1635>>>>>>>>>//  attached to validation tables which can then be used for
1635>>>>>>>>>//  validation (if Validate_state is true) or list loading.
1635>>>>>>>>>//  Developers can create their own validation tables as long as they
1635>>>>>>>>>//  conform to the following external interface:
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>// Properties
1635>>>>>>>>>//   Static_State       - if list must be rebuilt each validation, load
1635>>>>>>>>>//   Allow_Blank_state  - If Blank or 0 is a valid response
1635>>>>>>>>>//   Validate_State     - should table be used for validation
1635>>>>>>>>>//   Table_Loaded_State - is the validation table initialized?
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>// Methods
1635>>>>>>>>>//  Get Validate_Value sValue to iVal - if iVal=0, it is legal
1635>>>>>>>>>//  Send Fill_list                    - fills a static list
1635>>>>>>>>>//  Send Request_Fill_From_List iObject iMessage
1635>>>>>>>>>//        This is a callback that will fill an external list by sending
1635>>>>>>>>>//        the passed message (iMessage) back to the requesting object
1635>>>>>>>>>//        (iObject). It will send this message for each item in the
1635>>>>>>>>>//        validation table. It always passes back four params. Those are:
1635>>>>>>>>>//                     iItem - Item count being passed back
1635>>>>>>>>>//                     sData - The Database value of the item
1635>>>>>>>>>//                     sDesc - The Value's description, "" if none
1635>>>>>>>>>//                     iFile - File number associated with the item (if any)
1635>>>>>>>>>//                     iRec  - Record associated with the item (if any)
1635>>>>>>>>>// Developers can create classes of any complexity to support validation
1635>>>>>>>>>// tables. We have provided the following four classes.
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>//  ValidationTable is an Array
1635>>>>>>>>>//           Provides simple one dimensional table support. The table must be
1635>>>>>>>>>//           loaded manually by creating fill_list and sending the message
1635>>>>>>>>>//           Add_Table_Value (send Add_Table_Value Value). If list is static
1635>>>>>>>>>//           it is filled once. If non-static it is filled each time it is
1635>>>>>>>>>//           requested to validate or fill a foreign lis.
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>//  DescriptionValidationTable is a ValidationTable
1635>>>>>>>>>//           Provides a more complex three dimension array allowing the
1635>>>>>>>>>//           object to store a data value, description value and a record
1635>>>>>>>>>//           number. The developer must fill this list using the Add_table_
1635>>>>>>>>>//           value message passing up to three values (data, desc, record).
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>//  FileValidationTable is a DescriptionValidationTable
1635>>>>>>>>>//           Provides a data aware table. This can be used to load data from
1635>>>>>>>>>//           data-files, from data-sets. If you use data-sets you can place
1635>>>>>>>>>//           constraints within the data-set. You must define the file-number,
1635>>>>>>>>>//           data-set (if any), the file index, the file's data field, and
1635>>>>>>>>>//           the file's description field. You can also define an optional
1635>>>>>>>>>//           "Type". All records are constrained to this type (with or with-
1635>>>>>>>>>//           data-sets). If is assumed that this file has an optimized finding
1635>>>>>>>>>//           index.
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>//  CodeValidationTable is a FileValidationTable
1635>>>>>>>>>//           Used for Code lists. Simply set Type_Value to the "type"
1635>>>>>>>>>//
1635>>>>>>>>>Use VDFBase.pkg
1635>>>>>>>>>
1635>>>>>>>>>
1635>>>>>>>>>Class ValidationTable is an Array
1636>>>>>>>>>    
1636>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
1638>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
1640>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Static_State        True
1641>>>>>>>>>        
1641>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Table_Loaded_State  False
1642>>>>>>>>>        
1642>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Validate_State      True
1643>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Allow_Blank_State   False
1644>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Main_File           0
1645>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Table_Title         DD_VALIDATION_LIST_TITLE
1646>>>>>>>>>        
1646>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Number_Elements     1
1647>>>>>>>>>        
1647>>>>>>>>>        // System maintained. Sub-classes use these
1647>>>>>>>>>        // These are SET by Next_Code_Record. You may GET their values
1647>>>>>>>>>        
1647>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Code            ''
1648>>>>>>>>>        
1648>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Description     ''
1649>>>>>>>>>        
1649>>>>>>>>>        Property RowID Current_RowId
1650>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1651>>>>>>>>>    
1651>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_Item_Count Returns Integer
1653>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Item_Count(Self))
1654>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1655>>>>>>>>>    
1655>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_Value Integer iItem Returns String
1657>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Value(Self,iItem))
1658>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1659>>>>>>>>>    
1659>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_Value Integer iItem String sValue
1661>>>>>>>>>        Set Value  iItem to sValue
1662>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1663>>>>>>>>>    
1663>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_Description Integer iItem Returns String
1665>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ''
1666>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1667>>>>>>>>>    
1667>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_Description Integer iItem String sValue
1669>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1670>>>>>>>>>    
1670>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_RowId Integer iItem Returns RowID
1672>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (NullRowId())
1673>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1674>>>>>>>>>    
1674>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_RowId Integer iItem RowID riValue
1676>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1677>>>>>>>>>    
1677>>>>>>>>>    
1677>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Add_Table_Value String sValue
1679>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Value  (Data_Item_Count(Self)) to sValue
1680>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1681>>>>>>>>>    
1681>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Value String sCode Returns Integer
1683>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMax
1683>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCnt
1683>>>>>>>>>        If (sCode = '');            Function_Return (not(Allow_Blank_State(Self)))
1686>>>>>>>>>        If (Table_Loaded_State(Self)=0 or Static_State(Self)=0) Begin
1688>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Data
1689>>>>>>>>>            Send Fill_list
1690>>>>>>>>>            Set Table_Loaded_State to True
1691>>>>>>>>>        End
1691>>>>>>>>>>
1691>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Item_Count to iMax
1692>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iMax
1693>>>>>>>>>        For iCnt from 0 to iMax
1699>>>>>>>>>>
1699>>>>>>>>>            If (sCode=Data_Value(Self,iCnt)) Begin
1701>>>>>>>>>                Set Current_Code        to sCode
1702>>>>>>>>>                Set Current_Description to (Data_Description(Self,iCnt))
1703>>>>>>>>>                Set Current_RowId       to (Data_RowId(Self,iCnt))
1704>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return 0
1705>>>>>>>>>            End
1705>>>>>>>>>>
1705>>>>>>>>>        Loop
1706>>>>>>>>>>
1706>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return 1 // 0=OK
1707>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
1708>>>>>>>>>    
