1801>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Value iCnt to sData
1802>>>>>>>>>        
1802>>>>>>>>>        // If one param passed use it for both display and database values
1802>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments <= 1);            Move sData  to sVal
1805>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move sDescr to sVal
1807>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Description iCnt to sVal
1808>>>>>>>>>        
1808>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments <= 2) ;            Move (NullRowId()) to riRecVal
1811>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move riRec        to riRecVal
1813>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_RowId iCnt to riRecVal
1814>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
