1983>>>>>>>>>>>// Interface:
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//  Procedure Initialize_File Integer File# Integer Index# Integer Code# ;
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//                            Integer Desc# Integer Type# String Type
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      This initializes the data-set for finding. You MUST pass all five
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      parameters here. They are:
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//          File#  -  main file to use
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//         Index#  - Index to use for finding
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//          Code#  - field number of the code
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//          Desc#  - field number of the code's description
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//          Type#  - field number of the constraining Type (0 if none)
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//           Type  - the constrain type value ('' = allow all records)
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      You MUST send this message before finding records. Alternately,
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      you could set the individual properties and send rebuild_constraints
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      and CLEAR to initalize the file (see code on how to do this).
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Next_Code_record to ret_Int
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      Returns the next record number. 0 if no more. If record exists it
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      sets the value of Current_Code and Crnt_Description.
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Current_Code to Ret_String
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Crnt_Description to Ret_String
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      Returns the code and description of the last valid record found
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//      with the Next_Code_Record Message
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//   Sample Usage:  This was created primarily to be used by the
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//                  radio-entry-form classes. In particular those using
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//                  the "code" look up file. Look at those packages if
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//                  you wish to use them yourself.
1983>>>>>>>>>>>//
1983>>>>>>>>>>>Use Data_Set.pkg
1983>>>>>>>>>>>
1983>>>>>>>>>>>Class Code_Loader_Data_Set is a DataSet
1984>>>>>>>>>>>    
1984>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object Integer Img#
1986>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object Img#
1988>>>>>>>>>>>        // These should be set by the Initialize_File message
1988>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Type_Value           '' // assume no defaults.
1989>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Type_Field           0  // These values should be
1990>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Field           0  // set by initialize_file
1991>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Description_Field    0  //
1992>>>>>>>>>>>        
1992>>>>>>>>>>>        // These are SET by Next_Code_Record. You may GET their values
1992>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Code         ''
1993>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Description  ''
1994>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1995>>>>>>>>>>>    
1995>>>>>>>>>>>    // If a Type exists (not a '') and there is a type field and a
1995>>>>>>>>>>>    // main_file constrain to the type. Else no constraints
1995>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnConstrain
1997>>>>>>>>>>>        String sType
1997>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
1997>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Value to sType
1998>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File  to iFile
1999>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Field to iField
2000>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sType<>'' and iFile<>0 and iField<>0) ;            Vconstrain iFile iField eq sType
2005>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //  This initializes the data-set for finding. You MUST pass all five
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //  parameters here. They are:
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //     File#  -  main file to use
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //    Index#  - Index to use for finding
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Code#  - field number of the code
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Desc#  - field number of the code's description
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Type#  - field number of the constraining Type (0 if none)
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //      Type  - the constrain type value ('' = allow all records)
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    //
2006>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Initialize_File Integer File# Integer Index# Integer Code# ;            Integer Desc# Integer Type# String Type
2008>>>>>>>>>>>        // note: all params are required!
2008>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Main_File         to File#
2009>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Ordering          to Index#
2010>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Code_Field        to Code#
2011>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Description_Field to Desc#
2012>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Type_Field        to Type#
2013>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Type_Value        to Type
