2020>>>>>>>>>>>        If not (Found) ;            Function_Return False
2023>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set properties Current_code and Current_Description
2023>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File to iFile
2024>>>>>>>>>>>        
2024>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field to iField
2025>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
2028>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Code to sValue
2029>>>>>>>>>>>        
2029>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iField
2030>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
2033>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Description to sValue
