2042>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FILE_LOGICAL_NAME of Codemast.File_number to sName
2045>>>>>>>>>>>            If (uppercase(trim(sName))="CODEMAST") Begin
2047>>>>>>>>>>>                Open CodeMast
2049>>>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
2050>>>>>>>>>>>            End
2050>>>>>>>>>>>>
2050>>>>>>>>>>>        End
2050>>>>>>>>>>>>
2050>>>>>>>>>>>        Open "CodeMast" as Codemast.File_number
2052>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
2053>>>>>>>>>>>    
