2060>>>>>>>>>>>            If (uppercase(trim(sName))="CODETYPE") Begin
2062>>>>>>>>>>>                Open CodeType
2064>>>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
2065>>>>>>>>>>>            End
2065>>>>>>>>>>>>
2065>>>>>>>>>>>        End
2065>>>>>>>>>>>>
