2360>>>>>>>>>End_Class
2361>>>>>>>// for text and binary. Must support Address Type
2361>>>>>>>
2361>>>>>>>// we need these from CLI.pkg for DAW drivers. These values must match what is defined
2361>>>>>>>// in cli.pkg
2361>>>>>>>Define DF_FILE_SQL_FILTER for 611
