3400>>>>>>>        If iDSO ;            Set Field_Current_Value of iDSO iField to sValue
3403>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
3404>>>>>>>
3404>>>>>>>    Procedure Set File_Field_Changed_Value Integer iFile Integer iField String sValue
3406>>>>>>>        Integer iDSO
