5733>>>>>>>    // Notify all DEOs that a field option has changed.
5733>>>>>>>    //   This message is sent by Set Field_Option
5733>>>>>>>    Procedure Field_Option_Changed Integer iField Integer iOptions Boolean bClear
5735>>>>>>>        Integer i iDEOs iDEO
5735>>>>>>>        Integer iMain_File
5735>>>>>>>        Get Main_File to iMain_File
5736>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_User_Interface_Count to iDEOs
5737>>>>>>>        Decrement iDEOs
5738>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iDEOs
5744>>>>>>>>
5744>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_User_Interface i to iDEO
5745>>>>>>>            If (Extended_DEO_State(iDEO)) ;                Send File_Field_Option_Changed of iDEO ;                iMain_File iField iOptions bClear
5748>>>>>>>        Loop
