5764>>>>>>>        Move (If(num_arguments>3, bSet, True)) to bSetTrue // support for old deprecated syntax
5765>>>>>>>        Get Data_set iFile to hoDD
5766>>>>>>>        If hoDD Begin
5768>>>>>>>            Set Field_Option of hoDD iField iOption to bSetTrue
5769>>>>>>>        End
5769>>>>>>>>
5769>>>>>>>
5769>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
5770>>>>>>>
5770>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Field_Option_Clear Integer iField Integer iOptions
5772>>>>>>>        Set Field_Option iField iOptions to False
