5778>>>>>>>
5778>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Field_Option_Toggle Integer iField Integer iOption
5780>>>>>>>        Integer iOldOption
5780>>>>>>>        Get Field_Options iField to iOldOption
5781>>>>>>>        // if old and new have overlapping bits, we assume clear
5781>>>>>>>        Set Field_Option iField iOption to ((iOldOption iand iOption)=0)
5782>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
