7282>>>>>>>>>>>/*Class for processing ini files. It parses an ini into memory and can serialize it. Use ParseString or ReadFromFile to load ini data, use Stringify or WriteToFile to generate / save the data. Use functions like SetValue and GetValue to read / manipulate valeus.*/
