7308>>>>>>>>>>>    /*    Reads an ini file from disk. If no file name is passed the psFileName property will be used, if     a filename is passed the psFileName will be updated. Returns true if the file is succesfully     read and parsed.         */
7308>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ReadFromFile String sOptFileName Returns Boolean
7310>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iChnl
