8048>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateWorkspaceData Handle hoCallBack Handle hmGeneric
8050>>>>>>>>>        String sPath
8050>>>>>>>>>        
8050>>>>>>>>>        If (psWorkspaceName(Self)="") ;            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack C_$WorkspaceNotUsed
8053>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
8054>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$WorkspaceDesc, psDescription(Self)))
8055>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$WorkspaceName, psWorkspaceName(Self)))
8056>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack ""
8057>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$Filelist, psFileList(Self)))
8058>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$DataPath, psDataPath(Self)))
8059>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$ProgramPath, psProgramPath(Self)))
8060>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$HelpPath, psHelpPath(Self)))
8061>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$BitmapsPath, psBitmapPath(Self)))
8062>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$SystemPaths, psSystemDfPath(Self)))
8063>>>>>>>>>            Send hmGeneric to hoCallBack (SFormat(C_$FullDFPath, psDfPath(Self)))
8064>>>>>>>>>        End
8064>>>>>>>>>>
8064>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
