8065>>>>>>>>>    Function OpenWorkspaceErrorMessage Integer eErrorCode Returns String
8067>>>>>>>>>        // Decodes the enumerated integer returned by OpenWorkspace and
8067>>>>>>>>>        // returns a corresponding message string.
8067>>>>>>>>>        String sError
8067>>>>>>>>>        
8067>>>>>>>>>        Case Begin
8067>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceOpened)
8069>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoErrors to sError
8070>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8071>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceNotFound)
8074>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsName to sError
8075>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8076>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceFileNotFound)
8079>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsFileFound to sError
8080>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8081>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsDataPathEmpty)
8084>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsDataPath to sError
8085>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8086>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsFileListEmpty)
8089>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsFileList to sError
8090>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8091>>>>>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsFileListNotExist)
8094>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$NoFileListCfg to sError
8095>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8096>>>>>>>>>            Case Else
8096>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$UnknownError to sError
8097>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
8098>>>>>>>>>        Case End
8098>>>>>>>>>        
8098>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sError-".")
8099>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
