8121>>>>>>>>>    Function CountOfPaths String sPaths Returns Integer
8123>>>>>>>>>        // Returns the number of paths defined in a string of paths
8123>>>>>>>>>        Integer iChar icChar icPath
8123>>>>>>>>>        
8123>>>>>>>>>        If (sPaths ="") ;            Function_Return 0
8126>>>>>>>>>        
8126>>>>>>>>>        Move (Length(sPaths) -1) to icChar
8127>>>>>>>>>        For iChar from 1 to icChar
8133>>>>>>>>>>
8133>>>>>>>>>            If (Mid(sPaths, 1, iChar) =";") ;                Increment icPath
8136>>>>>>>>>        Loop
8137>>>>>>>>>>
8137>>>>>>>>>        
8137>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (icPath +1)
8138>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
