8292>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateKey String sKeyName Returns Integer // return=error code
8294>>>>>>>>>        // Calling CreateKey for an existing Key, merely opens it without error.
8294>>>>>>>>>        Handle hKey hKeyOpened
8294>>>>>>>>>        Integer iError
8294>>>>>>>>>        String sError
8294>>>>>>>>>        
8294>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to hKeyOpened // initialize it so we can get its address
8295>>>>>>>>>        
8295>>>>>>>>>        Get phRootKey to hKey
8296>>>>>>>>>        
8296>>>>>>>>>        Move (RegCreateKeyEx(hKey, sKeyName, 0, 0, REG_OPTION_NON_VOLATILE, pfAccessRights(Self), 0, AddressOf(hKeyOpened), 0)) to iError
8297>>>>>>>>>        If (iError =0) ;            Set phCurrentKey to hKeyOpened
8300>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
8301>>>>>>>>>            Move (FormatWinError(iError)) to sError // raise an error if the Query failed
8302>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_REGISTRY sError // Generic Windows Error
8303>>>>>>>>>>
8303>>>>>>>>>        End
8303>>>>>>>>>>
8303>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iError
8304>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
