8310>>>>>>>>>            If (pbLazyWrite(Self)) ;                Move (RegCloseKey(hKey)) to iError
8313>>>>>>>>>            Else ;                Move (RegFlushKey(hKey)) to iError
8315>>>>>>>>>            
8315>>>>>>>>>            Set phCurrentKey to 0
8316>>>>>>>>>        End
8316>>>>>>>>>>
8316>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
