8320>>>>>>>>>        
8320>>>>>>>>>        Get phRootKey to hKey
8321>>>>>>>>>        Move (RegOpenKeyEx(hKey, sKeyName, 0, pfAccessRights(Self), AddressOf(hKeyOpened))) to iError
8322>>>>>>>>>        If (iError =0) ;            Set phCurrentKey to hKeyOpened
8325>>>>>>>>>        
8325>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (iError=0)
8326>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
