8351>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WriteString WString sValue WString wValueData
8353>>>>>>>>>        Handle hKey
8353>>>>>>>>>        Integer iError cbData
8353>>>>>>>>>        String sError
8353>>>>>>>>>        
8353>>>>>>>>>        If (wValueData = "") Begin
8355>>>>>>>>>            Move (Character(0)) to wValueData
8356>>>>>>>>>            Move 1 to cbData
8357>>>>>>>>>        End
8357>>>>>>>>>>
8357>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
8358>>>>>>>>>            Move ((SizeOfWString(wValueData) +1)*2) to cbData
8359>>>>>>>>>        End
8359>>>>>>>>>>
8359>>>>>>>>>        Get phCurrentKey to hKey
8360>>>>>>>>>        Move (RegSetValueExW(hKey, sValue, 0, REG_SZ, AddressOf(wValueData), cbData)) to iError
8361>>>>>>>>>        If iError Begin
8363>>>>>>>>>            Move (FormatWinError(iError)) to sError // raise an error if the Query failed
8364>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_REGISTRY sError // Generic Windows Error
8365>>>>>>>>>>
8365>>>>>>>>>        End
8365>>>>>>>>>>
8365>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
