8694>>>>>>>        Get RegistryKeyString to sKey
8695>>>>>>>        If (sSubKey <>"") ;            Move (sKey +'\' +sSubKey) to sKey
8698>>>>>>>        Get CreateKey of hoRegistry sKey to iError
8699>>>>>>>        If (iError = 0) Begin
