8702>>>>>>>            Send CloseKey of hoRegistry
8703>>>>>>>        End
8703>>>>>>>>
8703>>>>>>>        
8703>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hoRegistry
8704>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
