9037>>>>>>>>>        
9037>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriverID
9038>>>>>>>>>        If (sDRiverID <> "") Begin
9040>>>>>>>>>            Call_Driver 0 sDRiverID Function CLI_GETSERIALNUM Callback 0 Passing sVoid sVoid 0 Result iRetval
9045>>>>>>>>>        End
9045>>>>>>>>>>
9045>>>>>>>>>        
9045>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iRetval
9046>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
