9061>>>>>>>>>        Integer iVoid
9061>>>>>>>>>        
9061>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriverID
9062>>>>>>>>>        If (sDriverID <> "") ;            Call_Driver 0 sDriverID Function CLI_DUMPSTATUS Callback 0 Passing sFileName sVoid iVoid Result iVoid
9069>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
