9070>>>>>>>>>    
9070>>>>>>>>>    // Reset all driver level configurable attributes to the
9070>>>>>>>>>    // default value and then reread the configuration.
9070>>>>>>>>>    //
9070>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ReadConfiguration
9072>>>>>>>>>        String  sVoid
9072>>>>>>>>>        String  sDriverID
9072>>>>>>>>>        Integer iVoid
9072>>>>>>>>>        
9072>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriverID
9073>>>>>>>>>        If (sDriverID <> "") ;            Call_Driver 0 sDriverID Function CLI_READCONFIGURATION Callback 0 Passing sVoid sVoid iVoid Result iVoid
9080>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
