9335>>>>>>>>>    Function DriverIndex String sDriver Returns Integer
9337>>>>>>>>>        
9337>>>>>>>>>        String  sCurrentDriver
9337>>>>>>>>>        Integer iNumberOfDrivers iDriver iCount
9337>>>>>>>>>        
9337>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iDriver
9338>>>>>>>>>        
9338>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_NUMBER_DRIVERS to iNumberOfDrivers
9341>>>>>>>>>        For iCount from 1 to iNumberOfDrivers
9347>>>>>>>>>>
9347>>>>>>>>>            
9347>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_DRIVER_NAME of iCount to sCurrentDriver
9350>>>>>>>>>            If ( Uppercase(sCurrentDriver) = Uppercase(sDriver) ) Begin
9352>>>>>>>>>                Move iCount to iDriver
9353>>>>>>>>>            End
9353>>>>>>>>>>
9353>>>>>>>>>        Loop
9354>>>>>>>>>>
9354>>>>>>>>>        
9354>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iDriver
9355>>>>>>>>>        
9355>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
