9959>>>>>>>>>        Integer iVariableBufferLength
9959>>>>>>>>>        
9959>>>>>>>>>        // Initialize
9959>>>>>>>>>        Move "" to sEmpty
9960>>>>>>>>>        Move 0  to iResult
9961>>>>>>>>>        
9961>>>>>>>>>        // Get the cli handles
9961>>>>>>>>>        Get phCLIStatementHandle  to ihstmt
9962>>>>>>>>>        Get phCLIConnectionHandle to ihdbc
9963>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverId            to sDrvrId
