10050>>>>>>>>>                Move ihstmt to giLastSQLhstmt
10051>>>>>>>>>                Move ihdbc to giLastSQLhdbc
10052>>>>>>>>>            End
10052>>>>>>>>>>
10052>>>>>>>>>            
10052>>>>>>>>>            Get piColumnCount to iColCount
10053>>>>>>>>>            If (iColCount) Begin
10055>>>>>>>>>                Get paSQLColumns to aSQLColumns
10056>>>>>>>>>                Get piHasVariableDataType to iHasVariableDataType
10057>>>>>>>>>                If (iHasVariableDataType) Begin
10059>>>>>>>>>                    Get piVariableBufferLength      to iVariableBufferLength
10060>>>>>>>>>                    Get piMaxVariableBufferLength   to iLen
10061>>>>>>>>>                    If (iLen > iVariableBufferLength) Begin
10063>>>>>>>>>                        // Allocate
