10069>>>>>>>>>                    End
10069>>>>>>>>>>
10069>>>>>>>>>                End
10069>>>>>>>>>>
10069>>>>>>>>>                
10069>>>>>>>>>                // Call the driver function to fetch
10069>>>>>>>>>                Call_Driver 0 sDrvrId Function FUNC_SQLFETCH Callback Self Passing ihdbc sEmpty ihstmt Result iResult
10074>>>>>>>>>                If (Err) ;                    Move 0 to iResult
10077>>>>>>>>>                
10077>>>>>>>>>                While (iResult <> 0)
10081>>>>>>>>>                    
10081>>>>>>>>>                    For iCol from 1 to (iColCount)
10087>>>>>>>>>>
