10089>>>>>>>>>                            
10089>>>>>>>>>                            Call_Driver 0 sDrvrId Function FUNC_SQLCOLUMNVALUE ;                                Callback 0 ;                                Passing sEmpty sEmpty iCol ;                                Result pResultWStr
10094>>>>>>>>>                            
