11322>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11323>>>>>>>    
11323>>>>>>>    // setting this property will change this new and all existing managed drivers
11323>>>>>>>    Procedure Set pbLoginOnOpen Boolean bLoginOnOpen
11325>>>>>>>        tDriverCLIDictionary[] DriverMap
11325>>>>>>>        tDriverCLIDictionary[] DriverMap
11326>>>>>>>        Integer i iDriver
11326>>>>>>>        Set private_pbLoginOnOpen to bLoginOnOpen
11327>>>>>>>        
11327>>>>>>>        // sets any existing registered drivers
11327>>>>>>>        Get pRegisteredDriversDict to DriverMap
11328>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (SizeOfArray(DriverMap)-1)
11334>>>>>>>>
11334>>>>>>>            Get DriverIndex DriverMap[i].sDriver to iDriver
11335>>>>>>>            Set_Attribute DF_DRIVER_LOGIN_ON_OPEN of iDriver to bLoginOnOpen
11338>>>>>>>        Loop
11339>>>>>>>>
11339>>>>>>>        
11339>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11340>>>>>>>    
11340>>>>>>>    Function pbLoginOnOpen Returns Boolean
