11636>>>>>>>    Function ConnectionIniFromCmdLine Returns String
11638>>>>>>>        Handle hoCmdLine
11638>>>>>>>        Integer iCount iArg iPos
11638>>>>>>>        String sArg sFile sLeft
11638>>>>>>>        Get psConnectionIdCmdLine to sLeft
11639>>>>>>>        Get phoCommandLine of ghoApplication to hoCmdLine
11640>>>>>>>        Get CountOfArgs of hoCmdLine to iCount
11641>>>>>>>        For iArg from 1 to iCount
11647>>>>>>>>
11647>>>>>>>            Get Argument of hoCmdLine iArg to sArg
11648>>>>>>>            If (Pos(Lowercase(sLeft),Trim(Lowercase(sArg)))=1) Begin
11650>>>>>>>                Move (Trim(Remove(sArg,1,Length(C_ConnectionIdCmdLineName)))) to sFile
11651>>>>>>>                Function_Return sFile
11652>>>>>>>            End
11652>>>>>>>>
11652>>>>>>>        Loop
11653>>>>>>>>
11653>>>>>>>        Function_Return ""
11654>>>>>>>    End_Function
11655>>>>>>>    
11655>>>>>>>    // gets qualified version of connections INI file using the rules for
11655>>>>>>>    // acquring this name. This file may not exist.
11655>>>>>>>    Function ConnectionIniFile Returns String
11657>>>>>>>        String sConnections sPath sPName
11657>>>>>>>        Boolean bCmdLineIniAllowed
