12735>>>>>>>        Handle hoNewElement
12735>>>>>>>        Get AddElement sTagName sValue to hoNewElement
12736>>>>>>>        If hoNewElement ;            Send Destroy to hoNewElement
12739>>>>>>>        Else ;            Error DFERR_XML_INTERNAL_ERROR (SFormat(C_$XmlMethodFailure, "msg_AddElement"))
12741>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
12742>>>>>>>    
