13157>>>>>>>    Function AttributeValueNS String sNameSpace String sBaseName Returns String
13159>>>>>>>        String sValue
13159>>>>>>>        Handle hinfcItem
13159>>>>>>>        Handle hoDoc hoTempAttributeNodes hoNode
13159>>>>>>>        Integer hinfcAttributes
13159>>>>>>>        
13159>>>>>>>        Get TempAttributeNodes to hoTempAttributeNodes
13160>>>>>>>        Get QualifiedItem of hoTempAttributeNodes sBaseName sNameSpace  to hinfcItem
13161>>>>>>>        Set XMLInterface of hoTempAttributeNodes to 0
13162>>>>>>>        If hinfcItem Begin
13164>>>>>>>            Get DocumentObject to hoDoc
13165>>>>>>>            Get phoTempDomNode of hoDoc to hoNode
13166>>>>>>>            Set XMLInterface of hoNode to hinfcItem
13167>>>>>>>            Get psNodeValue of hoNode to sValue
13168>>>>>>>            Set XMLInterface of hoNode to 0
13169>>>>>>>        End
13169>>>>>>>>
13169>>>>>>>        Function_Return sValue
13170>>>>>>>    End_Function
13171>>>>>>>    
13171>>>>>>>    Procedure RemoveAttributeNS String sNameSpace String sBaseName
13173>>>>>>>        Handle hoAttrs hoAttr
