13532>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebErrorHandler is a cBaseErrorHandler
13533>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
13535>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
13537>>>>>>>>>>>    
13537>>>>>>>>>>>        // this should not get set to a value until the COM object is created
13537>>>>>>>>>>>        // and is working. When set, the error handler knows it that it can
13537>>>>>>>>>>>        // send error messages to the COM handler.
13537>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle  phoInetSession  0
13538>>>>>>>>>>>    
13538>>>>>>>>>>>        // We will store Err# in the main error object
13538>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oErrorNumber is an Array
13540>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
13541>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oErrorText is an Array
13543>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
13544>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oFullErrorText is an Array
13546>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
13547>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oFileNr is an Array
13549>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
13550>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oFieldNr is an Array
13552>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
13553>>>>>>>>>>>        Object oLineNr is an Array
13555>>>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
