13721>>>>>>>>>>>    
13721>>>>>>>>>>>     
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    //
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    // Enumerate all errors.
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    // For each error send iMsg to hObj passing all required error
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    // information: iErr#, sErrorMsg, iLine, iFile, iField
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    //
13721>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateErrors Integer iMsg Integer hObj
13723>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
13723>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13724>>>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
13725>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
13731>>>>>>>>>>>>
13731>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ErrorReportCallback i iMsg hObj
13732>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
13733>>>>>>>>>>>>
13733>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
13734>>>>>>>>>>>    
13734>>>>>>>>>>>    // if item is -1 it is last error
13734>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ErrorReportCallback Integer iItem Integer iMsg Integer hObj
13736>>>>>>>>>>>        String  sErrMsg
13736>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFileNr iFieldNr iErrNr iLineNr
13736>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
13736>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13737>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
13740>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
13742>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrNr   iItem to iErrNr
13743>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrMsg  iItem to sErrMsg
13744>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_LineNr  iItem to iLineNr
13745>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FileNr  iItem to iFileNr
13746>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FieldNr iItem to iFieldNr
13747>>>>>>>>>>>            Send iMsg to hObj iErrNr sErrMsg iLineNr iFileNr iFieldNr
13748>>>>>>>>>>>        End
13748>>>>>>>>>>>>
13748>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
13749>>>>>>>>>>>    
13749>>>>>>>>>>>    // this is used to remove a single error from the queue
13749>>>>>>>>>>>    // if iItem is -1, last error
13749>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClearError Integer iItem
13751>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
13751>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13752>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
13755>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
13757>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item iItem
13758>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oErrorText iItem
13759>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oLineNr    iItem
13760>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFileNr    iItem
13761>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFieldNr   iItem
13762>>>>>>>>>>>        End
13762>>>>>>>>>>>>
13762>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
13763>>>>>>>>>>>    
13763>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ErrorMessage Integer iItem Returns String
13765>>>>>>>>>>>        String  sErrMsg
13765>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
13765>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
13766>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
13769>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) ;            Get Error_ErrMsg iItem to sErrMsg
