14199>>>>>>>>>        Get find_element sWpoName to iCount // search for Dups
14200>>>>>>>>>        If (iCount >= 0) ; // if found, we have an error            Error 900 (SFormat(C_$WBONameAlreadyExists, sWpoName))
14203>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
14204>>>>>>>>>            Get Wpo_Count to iCount
14205>>>>>>>>>            Set Value           iCount to sWpoName
14206>>>>>>>>>            Set Value of oWpoID iCount to iWpoID
14207>>>>>>>>>        End
