14226>>>>>>>>>// The cVDFInternetSession class is considered private. All WBOs talk to this
14226>>>>>>>>>// by sending messages to the ghInetSession handle but this entire interface is
14226>>>>>>>>>// is private. All public access is defined in the WBOs and in the cWebApp object
