15366>>>>>>>// This is the main class for the HTTP Handler end point of the WebApp Server. It supports handling
15366>>>>>>>// of raw HTTP requests in pure DataFlex code. An IIS Module (WasHttpMod.dll) forwards requests to
15366>>>>>>>// cWebHttpHandler objects based on configuration written into web.config by the DataFlex Studio.
15366>>>>>>>
15366>>>>>>>// Error styles supported by peErrorType(cWebHttpHandler)
15366>>>>>>>Enum_List
15366>>>>>>>    Define httpErrorHtml
15366>>>>>>>    Define httpErrorJson
15366>>>>>>>    Define httpErrorSoap
15366>>>>>>>    Define httpErrorEmpty
15366>>>>>>>End_Enum_List
15366>>>>>>>
15366>>>>>>>// Chunk size used by cWebMultipartFormdataHandler and cWebResourceManagerProxy
15366>>>>>>>Define HTTP_FILESIZE_UNKNOWN for |CV$FFFFFFFF
15366>>>>>>>
15366>>>>>>>Class cWebHttpHandler is a cBaseWebComponent
15367>>>>>>>    
15367>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
15369>>>>>>>        String sBPOName
15369>>>>>>>        
15369>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
15371>>>>>>>        
15371>>>>>>>        Property String psPath "WebHttpHandler"         // IIS configuration path for which requests should be handled
15372>>>>>>>        Property String psVerbs "*"                     // Comma separate list of verbs filtering requests
15373>>>>>>>        Property Integer peErrorType httpErrorHtml      // Format in which errors that can't be handled in DataFlex are sent
15374>>>>>>>        
15374>>>>>>>        Property String psRequestVerb ""                // Contains the verb of the request while handling a request
15375>>>>>>>        Property String psRequestPath ""                // Contains the path of the request while handling a request
15376>>>>>>>        Property String psRequestQueryString ""         // Contains the querystring of the request while handling a request
15377>>>>>>>        Property String psRequestContentType ""         // Contains the content-type heade rvalue of the request while handling a request
15378>>>>>>>        Property String psRequestAcceptType ""          // Contains the accept-type header value of the request while handling a request
15379>>>>>>>        Property DWord piRequestSize 0                // Contains the size of the request while handling a request
15380>>>>>>>        
15380>>>>>>>        Property Integer peRequestCodePage CP_UTF8      // Configures character conversion when reading strings from the requests
15381>>>>>>>        Property Integer peResponseCodePage CP_UTF8     // Configures character conversion writing strings to the response
15382>>>>>>>        
15382>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbDataSent False               // True if data is already sent to the client (blocks AddHttpResonseHeader and SetResponseStatus
15383>>>>>>>        
15383>>>>>>>        // register BPO
15383>>>>>>>        Get Object_Label to sBPOName
15384>>>>>>>        Send Set_HttpH_Data of ghInetSession sBPOName Self
15385>>>>>>>        
15385>>>>>>>        Object oCharTranslator is a cCharTranslate
15387>>>>>>>        End_Object
15388>>>>>>>        
15388>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
