15586>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebAppBase_Mixin
15588>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTemp
15588>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCmdLine
15588>>>>>>>>>        
15588>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peAttachStatus C_asUndefined
15589>>>>>>>>>        
15589>>>>>>>>>        // An Application object must exist for WebApp to work. If missing, this is a fatal programming error
15589>>>>>>>>>        If (ghoApplication=0) Begin
15591>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$MissingApplicationObject
15592>>>>>>>>>>
15592>>>>>>>>>            Abort
15593>>>>>>>>>>
15593>>>>>>>>>        End
15593>>>>>>>>>>
15593>>>>>>>>>
15593>>>>>>>>>        // WebApp uses the command line object to process arguments. We will send countOfArgs
15593>>>>>>>>>        // to force the command-line object to get all arguments and load the in the object.
15593>>>>>>>>>        // This removes the argument...so you cannot use cmdline anywhere in a WebApp
15593>>>>>>>>>        Get phoCommandLine of ghoApplication to hoCmdLine
15594>>>>>>>>>        Get CountOfArgs of hoCmdLine to iTemp
15595>>>>>>>>>        
15595>>>>>>>>>        Object oVDFInetSession is a cVDFInternetSession
15597>>>>>>>>>        End_Object
15598>>>>>>>>>        
15598>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
