16185>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paWebPropertyMeta to details
16186>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
16186>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hmSetter to search.hmSetter
16187>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(search, details, False)) to iPos
16188>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
16188>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iPos <> -1) ;            Function_Return details[iPos]
16191>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
