16472>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the owner of the object which is the host (cWebApp/cLocalWebControlHost) or the cWebDynamicObjectContainer.
16472>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Owner Returns Handle
16474>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOwner
16474>>>>>>>>>>>
16474>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoOwner to hoOwner
16475>>>>>>>>>>>        
16475>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoOwner = C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
16477>>>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get FindOwner to hoOwner
16479>>>>>>>>>>>
16479>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoOwner = C_WebUnresolvedObject) ;                Error DFERR_PROGRAM "WebObject without owner"
16482>>>>>>>>>>>            
16482>>>>>>>>>>>            Set phoOwner to hoOwner
16483>>>>>>>>>>>        End
16483>>>>>>>>>>>>
16483>>>>>>>>>>>        
16483>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoOwner
16484>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
16485>>>>>>>>>>>    
