16554>>>>>>>>>>>    // Retrieves the action data for a server action as value tree. Available to support older 
16554>>>>>>>>>>>    // controls working with value trees, this function performs the conversion from JSON handle.
16554>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ptActionData Returns tWebValueTree
16556>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJsonObj
16556>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree result
16556>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree result
16556>>>>>>>>>>>        
16556>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJsonObj
16557>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoJsonObj <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
16559>>>>>>>>>>>            If (IsOfJsonType(hoJsonObj, jsonTypeObject)) Begin
16561>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbRequireAllMembers of hoJsonObj to False
16562>>>>>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJsonObj to result
16563>>>>>>>>>>>            End
16563>>>>>>>>>>>>
16563>>>>>>>>>>>        End
16563>>>>>>>>>>>>
16563>>>>>>>>>>>        
16563>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return result
16564>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
