17961>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added server scan logic here instead of add_focus.
17961>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
17963>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer obj# isclient srvscn wsrvr
17963>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to obj#
17964>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get client_area_state to isclient
17965>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (obj# <> 0) ;            Send add_user_interface to obj# Self
17968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get private.Servers_Scanned to srvscn
17969>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (srvscn = 0) ;            Send scan_servers
17972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to wsrvr
17973>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If wsrvr Send add_user_interface ;            to wsrvr Self True // TRUE for watchers
17976>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (obj# <> 0 and isclient = 0) ;            Send update_dependent_items
17979>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17980>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
17980>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Removed server scan logic and moved it to attach-deo_to_server
17980>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Add_Focus Handle hoParent Returns Integer
17982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer srvscn retval msg
17982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
17982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // standard DEO behavior
17982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
17982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Get msg_Add_Focus hoParent to retval
17984>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If retval ;            Procedure_Return retval
17987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (client_area_State(Self) = 0) ; //clients already broadcast            Broadcast NO_STOP Send add_focus Self
17992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
17992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // server augmentation
17992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
17992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (focus_mode(Self) <> NO_ACTIVATE and Active_State(Self)) ;            Send attach_DEO_to_server
17995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // last thing to do is send custom message. With list deos
17995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // msg is probably initialize_list. With non-list deos it
17995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // is probably nothing
17995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get add_focus_msg to msg
17996>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If msg ;            Send msg
17999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
