18000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Connect DEO to Server if Demanded (DoAllfg=t) or ;
18000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allowed  (static_server_State=t). Broadcast if children exist
18000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Connect_DEOs_to_Servers Integer DoAllFg
18002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (DoAllfg or Static_Server_State(Self)) ;            Send Attach_Deo_to_Server
18005>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Has_Components_State(Self)) ;            Broadcast Send Connect_DEOs_to_Servers DoAllfg
18009>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Disconnect DEOs from Servers according to rules. Broadcast
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // to child components.
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Pass: DoAllMode
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    DETACH_NEVER        Never
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    DETACH_IF_NO_CHANGE Do if changed_state=F
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    DETACH_ALWAYS       Do it no matter what
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    DETACH_IF_ALLOWED   Do if changed_state=F and auto_attach
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                        (I don't think this will be needed!)
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Disconnect_DEOs_from_Servers Integer DoAllMode
18012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (DoAllMode <> DETACH_NEVER) Begin
18014>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If ( DoAllMode=DETACH_ALWAYS or ; // do all no matter what                ( (Changed_state(Self)=0) and ;                ( (DoAllMode=DETACH_IF_NO_CHANGE) or  ;                (Static_Server_State(Self)) ) ) ) ;                Send Remove_deo_from_server
18017>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (Has_Components_State(Self)) ;                Broadcast Send Disconnect_DEOs_from_Servers DoAllMode
18021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Changed to not remove from server if static.
18022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Remove_Object
18024>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send remove_object
18026>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // remove if not static and no changes
18026>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ( Static_Server_State(Self)=0 and ;            Changed_State(Self)=0 ) ;  // only detach if unchanged!            Send remove_DEO_from_server
18029>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (JJT) Changed so that this respects Change_disabled_state. I don't
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //       like this here but its the best I can think of. Therefore, all
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //       objects using server.pkg must understand Change_disabled_state.
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (JJT) Checks deferred_state and if set do not change the
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // changed state of the server object. This had been in datalist and is
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required to make deferred_state work right. Deferred_state was created
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // to make selection-lists work correctly and as far as I am concerned it
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // should be the only supported use of this. Therefore, I would not *ever*
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // expect deferred_state to be set true in tables, entry_forms, or text_
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // windows. Since deferred-state is known to this mixin the change
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // belongs here - but I expect it to only ever change behaviors in
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // selection-lists.
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Changed to not remove from server if static.
18030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Changed_State Integer newVal
18032>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer srvr# wsrvr
18032>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not (Change_Disabled_State(Self)) Begin
18034>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Set Changed_State to newVal
18036>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get server to srvr#
18037>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18037>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if deferred keep the server out of it.
18037>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If not (deferred_State(Self)) Begin
18039>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (newVal and srvr#) Begin
18041>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Set Changed_State of srvr# to True
18042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    // We also set changed_state of all "foreign" servers. These
18042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    // are the ones whose Data_File is a parent File
18042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get ChangedStateWatched_Servers to wsrvr
18043>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If wsrvr ;                        Set Changed_State of wSrvr to True
18046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
18046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
18046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                // Remove is changed-state=false, not active and not static
18046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If ( not(newVal) and not(Active_State(Self)) and ;                    not(Static_Server_State(Self)) ) ;                    Send remove_DEO_from_Server
18049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // When an object is created this sets the default value for
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Static_Server_state. If a parent DEO exists it will use its
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // static_server_state property. An Entry_view_Client0 object sets
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // this - this way view based daf programs will use the new behavior
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (although it can be disabled)  but non-daf programs will work like
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // they always did.
18050>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Default_Static_Server_State Returns Integer
18052>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer rVal
18052>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // We delegate to get the actual (not default) static state
18052>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note: Can't check with component_state - it not defined yet
18052>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Get Static_Server_State to rVal
18054>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return rVal
18055>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18056>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18056>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
18056>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
18056>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
18056>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
18058>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
18058>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
18058>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
18059>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
18065>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18065>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
18066>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
18067>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
18068>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
18069>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18069>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
