18195>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18195>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitLocalizationProperties
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This is called by Construct_Object. We perform these property settings in a separate routine
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // so that the Studio's parser does not parse the Set Property statements at the end. Parsing
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // these Set statements would cause the properties to be shown read-only in the properties panel.
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDateSeparator iDecimalSeparator iThousandsSeparator iDateFormat
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sDateFormat sCurrencySymbol sDateSeparator sDecimalSeparator sThousandsSeparator
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Default_Currency_Symbol()) to sCurrencySymbol
18198>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18198>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DECIMAL_SEPARATOR   to iDecimalSeparator
18201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_THOUSANDS_SEPARATOR to iThousandsSeparator
18204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DATE_SEPARATOR      to iDateSeparator
18207>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DATE_FORMAT         to iDateFormat
18210>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18210>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iDecimalSeparator))   to sDecimalSeparator
18211>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iThousandsSeparator)) to sThousandsSeparator
18212>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iDateSeparator))      to sDateSeparator
18213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Case Begin
18213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_USA)
18215>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("mm/dd/yyyy") to sDateFormat
18216>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
18217>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18217>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_EUROPEAN)
18220>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("dd/mm/yyyy") to sDateFormat
18221>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
18222>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18222>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_MILITARY)
18225>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("yyyy/mm/dd") to sDateFormat
18226>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
18227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Case End
18227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18227>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDecimalSeparator   to sDecimalSeparator
18228>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psThousandsSeparator to sThousandsSeparator    
18229>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psCurrencySymbol     to sCurrencySymbol
18230>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateFormat         to sDateFormat
18231>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateTimeFormat     to (sDateFormat * "hh:mm:ss")
18232>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateSeparator      to sDateSeparator
18233>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Sends navigateRefresh to the client to reload the web application.
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This will clear all loaded views and zero all web properties. You would
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // send this message to restart the WebApp and trigger a new user login.
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also "UnloadView" method of cWebView.
18234>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigateRefresh
18236>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "navigateRefresh"
18237>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Opens a new URL in: current browser or new tab or new window.
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // sURL           - Is the URL to navigate to.
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // eBrowserTarget - Determines where the URL will be shown. Can be one of:
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  btCurrentWindow, btNewTab, btNewWindow
18238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigateToPage String sURL Integer eBrowserTarget
18240>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18241>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18241>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sURL                     to aParams[0]
18242>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(eBrowserTarget)) to aParams[1]
18243>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "navigateToPage" aParams
18244>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18245>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18245>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Opens the URL in a new window.
18245>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigateNewWindow String sUrl Integer iWidth Integer iHeight
18247>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18248>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18248>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sURL                     to aParams[0]
18249>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iWidth                   to aParams[1]
18250>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iHeight                  to aParams[2]
18251>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18251>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "navigateNewWindow" aParams
18252>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18253>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18253>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows a message in a modal dialog on the client. When called multiple times 
18253>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  the dialogs are shown after each other (not on top of each other).
18253>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowInfoBox String sMessage String sOptCaption
18255>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18256>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18256>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sMessage to aParams[0]
18257>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments >= 2) Begin
18259>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to aParams[1]
18260>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18260>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18260>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18261>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Information to aParams[1]
18262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showInfoBox" aParams        
18263>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows a message box on the client and passes it an object name and method 
18264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  name that will Handle the result. The result will be an Integer indicating which button is 
18264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  clicked.
18264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowMessageBox Handle hoObj Handle hoReturnMsg String sMessage String sOptCaption String sOptLabelCSSClass Integer eOptDefaultButton String[] asOptButtons
18266>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams aButtons 
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sReturnMethod
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Search for publiced reutrn message
18268>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName of hoObj hoReturnMsg to sReturnMethod
18269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sReturnMethod <> "") Begin
18271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectName of hoObj to aParams[0]    //  Translate handle to object name
18272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sReturnMethod         to aParams[1]    //  Translate message id to method name
18273>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMessage              to aParams[2]    //  Determine further parameters 
18274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           
18274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
18276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move sOptCaption       to aParams[3]
18277>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18277>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18277>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18278>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$Information    to aParams[3]
18279>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18279>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18279>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18279>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 4) Begin
18281>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move sOptLabelCSSClass to aParams[4]
18282>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18282>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18282>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18283>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ""                to aParams[4]
18284>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18284>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18284>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18284>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 5) Begin
18286>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move eOptDefaultButton to aParams[5]
18287>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18287>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18287>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18288>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move 0                 to aParams[5]
18289>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18289>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18289>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18289>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 6) Begin
18291>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move asOptButtons to aButtons
18292>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18292>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18292>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18293>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$Yes       to aButtons[0]
18294>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$No        to aButtons[1]
18295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Add client action
18295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "showMessageBox" aParams aButtons            
18296>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18296>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18296>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18297>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18297>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows a message box with yes and no buttons.
18297>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowYesNo Handle hoCallBack Handle hmCallback String sMessage String sOptCaption Integer eOptDfltBtn
18299>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sCSSClass sCaption
18299>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] ButtonTextArray
18300>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDflt
18300>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18300>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Yes to ButtonTextArray[0]
18301>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$No to ButtonTextArray[1]
18302>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18302>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
18304>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to sCaption
18305>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18305>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18305>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18306>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Confirm  to sCaption
18307>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18307>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18307>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18307>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Num_Arguments > 4) Begin
18309>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move eOptDfltBtn to eDflt
18310>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18310>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18310>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18311>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move 2 to eDflt //cmNo to eDflt
18312>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18312>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18312>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18312>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "WebMsgBoxConfirm" to sCSSClass // assume this defines any images and other features for a yes/no dialog.    
18313>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18313>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ShowMessageBox hoCallBack hmCallback sMessage sCaption sCSSClass eDflt ButtonTextArray
18314>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18315>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18315>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows a message box with yes and no buttons.
18315>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowYesNoCancel Handle hoCallBack Handle hmCallback String sMessage String sOptCaption Integer eOptDfltBtn
18317>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sCSSClass sCaption
18317>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] ButtonTextArray
18318>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDflt
18318>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18318>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Yes to ButtonTextArray[0]
18319>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$No to ButtonTextArray[1]
18320>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Cancel to ButtonTextArray[2]
18321>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18321>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
18323>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to sCaption
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18324>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18325>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Confirm to sCaption
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18326>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Num_Arguments > 4) Begin
18328>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move eOptDfltBtn to eDflt
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18329>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18330>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move 3 to eDflt //cmCancel to eDflt
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18331>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "WebMsgBoxConfirm" to sCSSClass // assume this defines any images and other features for a yes/no dialog.    
18332>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18332>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ShowMessageBox hoCallBack hmCallback sMessage sCaption sCSSClass eDflt ButtonTextArray
18333>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Updates the title of the web page based on the provided string.
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  sTitle  The new page title.
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18334>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetPageTitle String sTitle
18336>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18337>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18337>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sTitle to aParams[0]
18338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "setPageTitle" aParams
18339>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows the provided text on the console of JavaScript debuggers (like 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  FireBug). This is a common debugging method in web applications comparable to Showln in 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  windows. The "Server: " String is added before the text to identify server-side log lines 
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  on the client.
18340>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClientLog String sText
18342>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18343>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move ("Server: " * sText) to aParams[0]
18344>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18344>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "log" aParams
18345>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Sends a forceResize which triggers a resize action after handling this call. 
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Usually this should happen autmatically when needed but this method provides a way to force
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  it.
18346>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClientResize
18348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "forceResize" aParams
18350>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Pushes a new state item to the browser its history stack. Implemented as a client action 
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (see history.pushState JavaScript API).
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the new history item.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the new history item.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Valuetree struct that is added as data to the history item. This allows 
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  custom information to be added for usage on back navigation.
18351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryPushState String sUrl String sTitle  tWebValueTree stateData
18353>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18354>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18354>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sUrl to aParams[0]
18355>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 1) Begin
18357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sTitle to aParams[1]
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 2) Begin
18360>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyPushState" aParams stateData
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18362>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyPushState" aParams 
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18363>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Replaces the current item in the browser its history stack. Implemented as client action and
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // maps to the history.replaceState JavaScript API.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the new history item.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the new history item.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Valuetree struct that is added as data to the history item. This allows 
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  custom information to be added for usage on back navigation.
18364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryReplaceState String sUrl String sTitle  tWebValueTree stateData
18366>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18367>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18367>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sUrl to aParams[0]
18368>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 1) Begin
18370>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sTitle to aParams[1]
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 2) Begin
18373>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyReplaceState" aParams stateData
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18374>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18375>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "historyReplaceState" aParams 
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Triggered by the client when a history popstate event occurs. This is a browser back 
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // navigation to an item that was added to the history stack using HistoryPushState. The 
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // ptActionData contains the tWebValueTree struct with data passed to HistoryPushItem.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title for the history item.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL for the history item.
18377>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HistoryPopState String sTitle String sUrl
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sStateHash
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree stateData
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree stateData
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ptActionData to stateData
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger public event
18380>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnHistoryPopState sTitle sUrl stateData
18381>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This event is called when the browser navigates back to a history item added using 
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // HistoryPushState. This allows the application to respond to the back navigation. If 
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // peApplicationStateMode is set to asmHistoryOnly or asmHistoryAndUrls then the framework will
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // have restored the state before this event is triggered.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sTitle      Page title of the history item.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sUrl        URL of the history item.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      stateData   Custom state data passed to HistoryPushState or HistoryReplaceState.
18382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnHistoryPopState String sTitle String sUrl tWebValueTree stateData
18384>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18384>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the client when the location hash changes (hashchange browser event) and triggers
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // a restorestate if needed and calls OnLocationHashChange.
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sHash       New location hash.
18385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure LocationHashChange String sHash
18387>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send OnLocationHashChange sHash
18388>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Triggers when the location hash changes (#.. part of the URL). Only fires if the hash change
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // is not caused by an pop state event, in that case OnHistoryPopState should be used.
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sHash   New location hash.
18389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnLocationHashChange String sHash
18391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18392>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18392>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnOrientationChange Integer iOrientation
18394>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is fired when the size of the browser window changes. This event can be used to 
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // make the web application layout responsive to the browser size. It gets the new dimensions
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // of the browser window passed as parameters.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  iWindowWidth    Width of the browser window in pixels.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  iWindowHeight   Height of the browser window in pixels.
18395>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnResizeWindow Integer iWindowWidth Integer iWindowHeight
18397>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Event that is fired when the operating systems prefered theme changes.
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It gets the new prefered theme of the operating system as a string
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // peThemePreference    Name of the new prefered theme
18398>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSystemThemePreferenceChange Integer eSystemThemePreference
18400>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18401>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18401>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_cWebHostAPI_mixin
18403>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnOrientationChange
18404>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnResizeWindow
18405>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure HistoryPopState
18406>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure LocationHashChange
18407>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnSystemThemePreferenceChange
18408>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18409>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
18410>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18410>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseUIObject_mixin is a mixin
18411>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties
18413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbEnabled True          // If False, the control cannot get the focus.
18416>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbRender True           // If False, the control's elements are removed from the HTML (see also pbVisible)
18419>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbVisible True          // If False, the control's elements are hidden (but still present) (see also pbRender)
18422>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piTabIndex 0            // Determines the control's position in the page tab order
18425>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psBackgroundColor ""     // CSS Inline Style - Color of the control's background
18428>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCSSClass ""            // CSS Class
18431>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psHtmlId ""              // HTML Element ID
18434>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psTextColor ""           // CSS Inline Style - Color of control's text
18437>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18437>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnRender ""      // Can be set to a JavaScript Event Handler that will be triggered immediately after rendering the control.
18440>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18440>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoAccessibilityCheck False   //  Use this property to disable the accessibility check (to allow JavaScript to show/enable controls)
18441>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18441>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piAccessibilityCacheCall 0 //  giWebAccCacheCtx value indicating if cached value is valid
18442>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piAccessibilityCache 0     //  Cached value of the accessibility number
18443>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnCloseModalDialog Handle hoModalDialog
18446>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18447>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18447>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Gives the focus to the control. If the control can't take the focus nothing will happen. If 
18447>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  sent to a container the focus will go to the first focusable control in that container.
18447>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Focus
18449>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "svrFocus"        
18450>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18451>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18451>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Apply focus to object within this view but only do it with
18451>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // non mobile clients.
18451>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ConditionalFocus
18453>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsMobile
18453>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbIsMobile of (Host(Self)) to bIsMobile
18454>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not bIsMobile Begin
18456>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Focus
18457>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18457>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18457>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18458>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AddKeyHandler Handle hMsg Integer iKeyCode Boolean bShift Boolean bAlt Boolean bCtrl
18460>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18461>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sMsg
18461>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18461>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName hMsg to sMsg
18462>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18462>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sMsg <> "") Begin
18464>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMsg       to aParams[0]
18465>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iKeyCode   to aParams[1]
18466>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bShift     to aParams[2]
18467>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bAlt       to aParams[3]
18468>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bCtrl      to aParams[4]
18469>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18469>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "addKeyHandler" aParams
18470>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18470>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18470>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18471>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18471>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RemoveKeyHandler Handle hMsg Integer iKeyCode Boolean bShift Boolean bAlt Boolean bCtrl
18473>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sMsg
18474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName hMsg to sMsg
18475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18475>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sMsg <> "") Begin
18477>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMsg       to aParams[0]
18478>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iKeyCode   to aParams[1]
18479>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bShift     to aParams[2]
18480>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bAlt       to aParams[3]
18481>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bCtrl      to aParams[4]
18482>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18482>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "removeKeyHandler" aParams
18483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18483>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Will attempt to scroll this UI object into the view. So parent containers will scroll if
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // nessecary to make this element visible.
18484>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ScrollIntoView Boolean bAlignToTop
18486>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
18487>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18487>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move bAlignToTop to aParams[0]
18488>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18488>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "scrollIntoView" aParams
18489>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18490>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18490>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnCloseModalDialog
18493>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18494>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Base class for Ajax Web Objects that model some client-side user interface.
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Supports:
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Properties to control rendering, visible, enabled etc.
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - HTML element support (#ID, Class, etc).
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Common CSS properties (color etc).
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Data binding to DDO server.
18495>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseUIObject is a cWebObject
18496>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18496>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
18498>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
18500>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18500>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Define_cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18501>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send DefineWebDragDropMixin
18502>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18503>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18503>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cWebDragDropMixin
18504>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cWebBaseUIObject_mixin
18505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if a control is rendered (if pbRender is true of itself and its parents)
18505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlRendered Returns Boolean
18507>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRendered
18507>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoParent
18507>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18507>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbRender to bRendered
18508>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18508>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bRendered) Begin
18510>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Parent to hoParent
18511>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoParent > 0) Begin
18513>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (IsObjectOfClass(hoParent, RefClass(cWebBaseUIObject))) Begin
18515>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsControlRendered of hoParent to bRendered
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18516>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bRendered
18517>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18518>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
