18544>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18544>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Augmented to invalidate the accessibility cache for the involved properties
18544>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Variant vPropValue
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Invalidate accessibility cache
18546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbRender) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbEnabled) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbVisible)) Begin
18548>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Increment giWebAccCacheCtx
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18549>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send SetSyncProp hoObject hmSetter sPropName vPropValue
18551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines if the control is currently accessible. Accessible means that it is a view that
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  is available on the client and it is rendered, visible and enabled. This check takes the 
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  state of parent controls into account, but not for example if the control is on the current 
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  tab page or if the group it is on is expanded.
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  This is used to check if a control should accept server messages and if DEO objects should 
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  communicate with DD's. Because it can be called a lot and the determination goes up in the 
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  object structure and involves server properties this value is cached.
18552>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsControlAccessible Boolean bVerifyEnabled Boolean bVerifyVisibility Returns Boolean
18554>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAccessible
18554>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iAccessible
18554>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18554>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get GetAccessible to iAccessible
18555>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18555>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_InSync) to bAccessible
18556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bVerifyEnabled and bAccessible) Begin
18558>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_Enabled) to bAccessible
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bVerifyVisibility and bAccessible) Begin
18561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessible iand C_UIA_Rendered and iAccessible iand C_UIA_Visible) to bAccessible
18562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bAccessible
18563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18564>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18564>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Determines th accessibility which is expressed folded into an integer and can be checked 
18564>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  using IAND.
18564>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetAccessible Returns Integer
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iAccessible iAccessibleParent
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bVal
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (piAccessibilityCacheCall(Self) <> giWebAccCacheCtx) Begin
18568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_UIA_InSync to iAccessible
18569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (pbNoAccessibilityCheck(Self)) Begin
18571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>               Move C_UIA_All to iAccessible
18572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
18573>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbRender to bVal
18574>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Rendered) to iAccessible
18577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
18577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbVisible to bVal
18578>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Visible) to iAccessible
18581>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
18581>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbEnabled to bVal
18582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Enabled) to iAccessible
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get GetAccessible to iAccessibleParent
18587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessibleParent iand iAccessible) to iAccessible
18588>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
18588>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
18589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCacheCall to giWebAccCacheCtx
18590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
18592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iAccessible
18593>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
18594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
18594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  By default UI objects are only accessible if they are visible and enabled.
18594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowServerAction Boolean ByRef bAllow String sMethodName Handle hoMessage Boolean bIsFunction String[] ByRef aParams
18596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsControlAccessible True True to bAllow
18597>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
