19135>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWebNeighborhood = C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
19137>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
19138>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19138>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19138>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19138>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ConditionalFocus of hoWebNeighborhood
19139>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
