19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows an info balloon next to the control (below or above) containing HTML.
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sCssClass   CSS Classname applied to the info balloon for custom styling.
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      sText       The content of the info balloon (HTML).
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
19262>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowInfoBalloon String sCssClass String sText Boolean bOptShow
19264>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
19265>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19265>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sCssClass      to aParams[0]
19266>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sText          to aParams[1]
19267>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments >= 3) Begin
19269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bOptShow   to aParams[2]
19270>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19270>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19270>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
19271>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move True       to aParams[2]
19272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19272>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showInfoBalloon" aParams
19273>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Hides the info balloon shown by ShowInfoBalloon.
19274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HideInfoBalloon
19276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "hideInfoBalloon"
19277>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
