19287>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure define_find_edit
19289>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kClear               Send Request_Clear      PRIVATE
19290>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kClear_All           Send Request_Clear_All  PRIVATE
19291>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kDelete_Record       Send Request_Delete     PRIVATE
19292>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kBegin_of_Data       Send Find_First         PRIVATE
19293>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kFind_Previous       Send Find_Previous      PRIVATE
19294>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kFind                Send Find_GE            PRIVATE
19295>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kFind_Next           Send Find_Next          PRIVATE
19296>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kEnd_of_Data         Send Find_Last          PRIVATE
19297>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSave_Record         Send Request_Save       PRIVATE
19298>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find          Send SuperFind          PRIVATE
19299>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find_Next     Send SuperFind_Next     PRIVATE
19300>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find_Previous Send SuperFind_Previous PRIVATE
19301>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Auto_Save_State      False
