19336>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Wrapping Returns Integer
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // if this is a child of a DEO, it will be saved by child_wrapping.
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // however, if this is not a child of a DEO, and we are wrapping,
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // and auto_save is true, save.
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
19338>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(component_state(Self)) and ;            auto_save_state(Self)) ;            Send request_Save
19341>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return 0
19342>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
