19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Supports:
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - User changable value.
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Apply DD attributes (Field Options, Mask, Datatyle, length, etc.
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - DDO request interface (Request_Find, Next, Previous, First, Last, Save, Delete, Clear, etc).
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Not Supported:
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Set Currency_Mask and Set Numeric_Mask interfaces are not supported. This is a confusing interface
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//   as it sets several properties and it is not possible to model in the Studio. It is better and more
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//   clear to just set each individual property as required psMask, peDataType and piMaxLength.
19348>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseDEO is a cWebBaseControl
19349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19349>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
19351>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
19353>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19353>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // these can be set via entry_item command....
19353>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_File 0    // The binding table
19354>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_Field 0   // The binding table column
19355>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged False   // Used when setting Field_Changed_Value on the DDO. This prevents processing the resulting File_Field_Value_Changed event.
19356>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoPrompt 0
19357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set true to stop DEOs from web-setting pbEnabled statically based
19357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // on the state of the DDO
19357>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbEnabledStatic False        
19358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
19358>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbCapslock C_WebDefault     // True if DD_Capslock. Set by data binding.
19361>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbChanged False             // True if the value was changed on the client
19364>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbFieldDefault False        // True if the value was set as a default value (Field_Default_Value)
19367>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbRequired C_WebDefault     // True if a non-null value is required to be entered. Set by data binding.
19370>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peAlign C_WebDefault        // Text alignment - alLeft, alRight, alCenter  ("not" set by DDO data binding. Usually the datatype will automatically determine the alignment but this property can override the automatic alignment)
19373>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peDataType C_WebDefault     // Determines the data type of the control's psValue data. Set by data binding.
19376>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbLimitDateRange True       // If true the client will limit dates to fit the DataFlex Date type (0001-01-01 -- 2500-01-1). Setting this to false can cause conversion errors.
19379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19379>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piMaxLength C_WebDefault    // Max number of characters that can be entered into this control. Set by data binding.
19382>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piPrecision C_WebDefault    // Max number of numbers that can be entered after the decimal point for a numeric data type.
19385>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMask ""                    // The mask string for this control. Set by data binding.
19388>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psValue ""                   // The value that is displayed in the control. Note: depending on the peDataType, the value may be formatted for data transfer, e.g. for typeDate, value is stored in universal format for transferring dates: yyyy-mm-dd.
19391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbHasControlError False    // Indicates it the client is showing errors, used as optimization to prevent a ClearControlErrors to be sent for every field cahnge
19394>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19394>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbServerOnValidate C_WebDefault
19397>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnValidate ""
19400>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbServerOnChange False
19403>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnChange ""
19406>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19406>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbServerOnAutoFind C_WebDefault
19409>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnAutoFind ""
19412>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19412>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoUpdateIfHidden True
19413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoFillIfHidden True
19414>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19414>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbDataBindable to True
19415>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
