20089>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
20090>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
20091>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoDDO <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
20093>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Validate_Field of hoDDO iFile iField to iResult
