20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
20111>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_ClearBindingTable
