20123>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
20124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
20126>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
