20186>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowFillDEO Boolean ByRef bAllow
20188>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bAllow) Begin
20190>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsControlAccessible False (pbNoFillIfHidden(Self)) to bAllow
20191>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20191>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20191>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20192>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
