20192>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      bAllow      ByRef boolean set to false if not allowed.
20192>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AllowUpdateDD Boolean ByRef bAllow
20194>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bAllow) Begin
20196>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsControlAccessible True (pbNoUpdateIfHidden(Self)) to bAllow
20197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
