20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>Use cWebObjectOwner_mixin.pkg
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// cWebRadio objects act in a co-ordinated way with other radio button objects as a collective "group"
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 1 or more groups of radio buttons can live together in the same container object.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// In a radio button group there is always one button object that is the "master" and the "slaves" in that group
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are connected to it. Which radio button is the master should be irrelevant to the developer.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// The psValue property of every radio button in a group is synchronized.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A group is defined by creating a master radio button and connecting slave buttons to it. Any button can be
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the master. The master button defines a group name and\or a data binding. The Data Binding and group name
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// is copied to each slave.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// 
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A slave can be connected to a master button by...
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// a) Setting the slave's phoMasterRadio property to the master's object handle.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// b) Seting the slave's psGroupName to the same group name as the master radio button.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// A radio button cannot change radio groups dynamically. Radio groups are configured at design time and connected
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// at object creation time. Once established, a radio group should not be changed.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// An empty\null psGroupName is allowed. A null group name will be converted into the object name of the radio's
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// container web panel object. All radio buttons with a null psGroupName in the same Web Panel belong to the same group.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Setting a radio button's data binding automatically set's its group name to "table_name.column_name".
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Groups are scoped to their view (or dialog). Button objects of the same group can be defined anywhere within
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the same view. Buttons in one view cannot be grouped to buttons of another view.
20207>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebRadio is a cWebBaseDEO    
20208>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Construct_Object:
20208>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20208>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
20210>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
20212>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20212>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterRadio            // Name of the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20215>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20215>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoMasterRadio 0         // Object handle to the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
20216>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20216>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
20216>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterName ""
20219>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psGroupName ""           // All radio buttons in a view with this group name belong to the same radio button group
20222>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psRadioValue ""          // This is the unique value for this radio button in its group. When the group's psValue matches psRadioValue then this radio button is selected.  
20225>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbServerOnSelect False  // Determines is the client will initiate an OnSelect event to the server when this radio button is selected.
20228>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnSelect ""      // Client event listner to fire for when this radio object is selected.
20231>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20231>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psCaption ""
20234>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20234>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbShowLabel to False
20235>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psJSClass to "df.WebRadio"
20236>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20237>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSelected
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sets this object as the currently selected radio object in its group.
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note: during WebApp initialization (while all the Web Objects are being created) then this
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // message will set the design-time psValue, at all other times it will WebSet the client's
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // synchronized psValue.
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInitWebApp
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20239>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Initializing of (Host(Self)) to bInitWebApp
20240>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bInitWebApp) Begin
20242>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psRadioValue to sValue
20243>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set psValue to sValue
20244>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20244>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20244>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20245>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psRadioValue to sValue
20246>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebSet psValue to sValue
20247>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20247>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20247>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20248>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetSelected Returns Boolean
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Returns True if this radio button is the currently selected radio in its group.
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note: during WebApp initialization (while all the Web Objects are being created) this
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // message will get the design-time psValue, at all other times it will WebGet the client's
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // synchronized psValue.
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sSelected sValue
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInitWebApp
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20250>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Initializing of (Host(Self)) to bInitWebApp
20251>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bInitWebApp) Begin
20253>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psRadioValue to sSelected
20254>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psValue to sValue
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20255>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20256>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psRadioValue to sSelected
20257>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebGet psValue to sValue
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20258>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sValue = sSelected)        
20259>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
20260>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20260>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20260>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSelect
20262>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sent to the radio button that has just been selected by the user at the client. Not sent if the
20262>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // radio button is selected programatically.
20262>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20263>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20263>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20263>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Returns Variant
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Overridden to re-direct WebGet psValue to the master radio button.
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoMasterRadio
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Variant vResult
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sResult sMasterRadio sDynamicObjectId
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamic bFound
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20265>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoMasterRadio to hoMasterRadio
20266>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicObject to bDynamic
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20267>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bDynamic) Begin
20269>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDynamicObjectId to sDynamicObjectId
20270>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
20270>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get FindRadioGroup sDynamicObjectId (&bFound) to tRadioGroup
20271>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20271>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bFound) Begin
20273>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject tRadioGroup.sMaster to hoMasterRadio
20274>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20274>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20274>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
20275>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Radio button %1 was not found.", sDynamicObjectId))
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20276>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hmSetter = RefProcSet(psValue) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbChanged)) and hoMasterRadio <> Self) Begin
20278>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get GetSyncProp of hoMasterRadio hoMasterRadio hmSetter sPropName to sResult  // get it from the master radio
20279>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return sResult
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20280>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20281>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Get GetSyncProp hoObject hmSetter sPropName to vResult
20283>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20283>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20283>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20283>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return vResult
20284>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
20285>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20285>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20285>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetSyncProp Handle hoObject Handle hmSetter String sPropName Variant vPropValue
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Overridden to re-direct WebGet psValue to the master radio button.
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoMasterRadio
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sResult sMasterRadio sDynamicObjectId
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamic bFound
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebDynamicRadioGroup tRadioGroup
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoMasterRadio to hoMasterRadio
20288>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicObject to bDynamic
20289>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20289>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bDynamic) Begin
20291>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDynamicObjectId to sDynamicObjectId
20292>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20292>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get FindRadioGroup sDynamicObjectId (&bFound) to tRadioGroup
20293>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20293>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bFound) Begin
20295>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get DynamicObject tRadioGroup.sMaster to hoMasterRadio
20296>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20296>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20296>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
20297>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM (SFormat("Radio button %1 was not found.", sDynamicObjectId))
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20298>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hmSetter = RefProcSet(psValue) or hmSetter = RefProcSet(pbChanged)) and hoMasterRadio <> Self) Begin
20300>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send SetSyncProp of hoMasterRadio hoMasterRadio hmSetter sPropName vPropValue
20301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20301>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20302>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Send SetSyncProp hoObject hmSetter sPropName vPropValue
20304>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20304>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20304>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20305>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20305>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20305>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
20307>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sGroupName
20307>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20307>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Publish the event methods....
20307>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnSelect
20308>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20308>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set the default psGroupName to the parent container object name....
20308>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psGroupName to sGroupName
20309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Trim(sGroupName) = "") Begin
20311>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get ContainerName to sGroupName
20313>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set psGroupName to sGroupName
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Register this radio button with the View\Dialog. This will ultimately
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // link together all radio buttons in the radio group....
20314>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Send AddRadio Self
20316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
20318>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20319>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
20320>>>>>>>>>>>Use tWebRadioGroup.pkg
20320>>>>>>>>>>>
20320>>>>>>>>>>>/*Defines the API used by radio's to register themselves to their container. Used by cWebWindow and cLocalWebControlHost.  */
20320>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebRadioContainer_mixin is a Mixin
20321>>>>>>>>>>>      
20321>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebRadioContainer_mixin
20323>>>>>>>>>>>        Property tWebRadioGroup[] paRadioGroups   // collection of radio button groups in this View\Dialog 
20324>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String[] paRadioGroupNames       // searchable array of group names that are stored in paRagioGroups. One member of paRadioGroups exists for each paRadioGroupNames
20325>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20326>>>>>>>>>>>    
20326>>>>>>>>>>>    
20326>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AddRadio Handle hoRadio
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        // Radio Button Helper:
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        // Registers the passed cWebRadio object. The object's group is determined and the radio
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        // is registered with the rest of the objects in that group. If this is the first radio
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        // object in the group then it will become the "master" radio object for that group.
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        String sGroupName
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iGroup icGroup icRadio
20328>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aRadioGroupNames
20329>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
20329>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
20330>>>>>>>>>>>        
20330>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psGroupName of hoRadio to sGroupName
20331>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
20332>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paRadioGroupNames to aRadioGroupNames
20333>>>>>>>>>>>        
20333>>>>>>>>>>>        // Is this a new group?....
20333>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(sGroupName, aRadioGroupNames, Desktop, RefFunc(DFSTRICMP))) to iGroup   // case insensitive search
20334>>>>>>>>>>>        
20334>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iGroup = -1) Begin
20336>>>>>>>>>>>            // Create a new group amd make this radio button the master....
20336>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups)) to icGroup
20337>>>>>>>>>>>            Move hoRadio    to aRadioGroups[icGroup].hoMaster
20338>>>>>>>>>>>            Move hoRadio    to aRadioGroups[icGroup].aRadioButtons[0]
20339>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sGroupName to aRadioGroups[icGroup].sGroupName
20340>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sGroupName to aRadioGroupNames[icGroup]
20341>>>>>>>>>>>            
20341>>>>>>>>>>>            // Save the changes....
20341>>>>>>>>>>>            Set paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
20342>>>>>>>>>>>            Set paRadioGroupNames to aRadioGroupNames
20343>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20343>>>>>>>>>>>>
20343>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20344>>>>>>>>>>>            // Add this radio to the existing group....
20344>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons)) to icRadio
20345>>>>>>>>>>>            Move hoRadio to aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons[icRadio]
20346>>>>>>>>>>>            
20346>>>>>>>>>>>            // Save the changes....
20346>>>>>>>>>>>            Set paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
20347>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20347>>>>>>>>>>>>
20347>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20348>>>>>>>>>>>    
20348>>>>>>>>>>>    
20348>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ConnectRadioButtons
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        // Radio button Helper:
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        //
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        // Iterate all of the registered radio groups and connect the cWebRadio objects to their master
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        // radio buttons.
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue sTemp sMaster
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoRadio
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iGroup icGroup 
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRadio icRadio
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
20350>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebRadioGroup[] aRadioGroups
20351>>>>>>>>>>>        
20351>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paRadioGroups to aRadioGroups
20352>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups)) to icGroup
20353>>>>>>>>>>>        
20353>>>>>>>>>>>        For iGroup from 0 to (icGroup-1)
20359>>>>>>>>>>>>
20359>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons)) to icRadio
20360>>>>>>>>>>>            Move "" to sValue
20361>>>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectName of aRadioGroups[iGroup].hoMaster to sMaster 
20362>>>>>>>>>>>            
20362>>>>>>>>>>>            For iRadio from 0 to (icRadio-1)
20368>>>>>>>>>>>>
20368>>>>>>>>>>>                // Set the master radio....
20368>>>>>>>>>>>                Move aRadioGroups[iGroup].aRadioButtons[iRadio] to hoRadio
20369>>>>>>>>>>>                Set phoMasterRadio of hoRadio to aRadioGroups[iGroup].hoMaster
20370>>>>>>>>>>>                If (hoRadio <> aRadioGroups[iGroup].hoMaster) Begin
20372>>>>>>>>>>>                    Set psMasterName of hoRadio to sMaster
20373>>>>>>>>>>>                End
20373>>>>>>>>>>>>
20373>>>>>>>>>>>                
20373>>>>>>>>>>>                // Get the last non-null psValue setting....
20373>>>>>>>>>>>                Get psValue of hoRadio to sTemp
20374>>>>>>>>>>>                If (sTemp <> "") Begin
20376>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move sTemp to sValue
