21056>>>>>>>>>
21056>>>>>>>>>    // Server-Action
21056>>>>>>>>>    //
21056>>>>>>>>>    // Server action that is called by the JavaScript engine opun initialization. It makes sure 
21056>>>>>>>>>    // that the object definitions of the global object and the initial view (phoLoginView or 
21056>>>>>>>>>    // phoDefaultView) including its DDO state. Also makes sure that translations are sent to the 
21056>>>>>>>>>    // client.
21056>>>>>>>>>    //
21056>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
21056>>>>>>>>>    //  bLoadInitial     If true (or not passed) the default (or login) view is loaded immediately 
21056>>>>>>>>>    //          and sent to the client. If displayView is used on the client this will be false.
21056>>>>>>>>>    // Returns:
21056>>>>>>>>>    //      The name of the initial view or dialog.
21056>>>>>>>>>    Function LoadWebApp Boolean bLoadInitial Returns String
21058>>>>>>>>>        String[] asBrowserLanguages asParams
21060>>>>>>>>>        Integer eAppStyle iBrowserTimezoneOffset iWidth iHeight
21060>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsLoggedIn bAllowAccess bOverrideState bOnResize
21060>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoView hoDefaultView hjObjectDef hjTranslations
21060>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21060>>>>>>>>>        tWebNameValue[] aTranslations
21061>>>>>>>>>        
21061>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger event allowing application to initialize things based on the client locales
21061>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pasBrowserLanguages to asBrowserLanguages
21062>>>>>>>>>        WebGet piBrowserTimezoneOffset to iBrowserTimezoneOffset
21063>>>>>>>>>        
21063>>>>>>>>>        Send OnInitializeLocales (If(SizeOfArray(asBrowserLanguages) > 0, asBrowserLanguages[0], "")) iBrowserTimezoneOffset
21064>>>>>>>>>        
21064>>>>>>>>>        //  Load translations (mark as 'early' client action so it executes before anything else)
21064>>>>>>>>>        Get ClientTranslations to aTranslations
21065>>>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hjTranslations
21066>>>>>>>>>        Send DataTypeToJson of hjTranslations aTranslations 
21067>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientActionEarly "initTranslations" asParams hjTranslations
21068>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjTranslations
21069>>>>>>>>>        
21069>>>>>>>>>        //  Trigger resize event
21069>>>>>>>>>        Get pbServerOnResizeWindow to bOnResize
21070>>>>>>>>>        If (bOnResize) Begin
21072>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piWindowWidth to iWidth
21073>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piWindowHeight to iHeight
21074>>>>>>>>>            
21074>>>>>>>>>            Send OnResizeWindow iWidth iHeight
21075>>>>>>>>>        End
21075>>>>>>>>>>
21075>>>>>>>>>        
21075>>>>>>>>>        //  Serialize Global Objects
21075>>>>>>>>>        Get SerializeObject to hjObjectDef
21076>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientActionEarly "createWebApp" asParams hjObjectDef 
21077>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hjObjectDef
21078>>>>>>>>>        
21078>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbIsLoaded to True
21079>>>>>>>>>        
21079>>>>>>>>>        If (bLoadInitial) Begin
21081>>>>>>>>>            Send Load_InitialView
21082>>>>>>>>>        End
21082>>>>>>>>>>
21082>>>>>>>>>         
21082>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ""
21083>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21084>>>>>>>>>    
21084>>>>>>>>>    //  Empty stub, called from loadWebApp, implemented in cWebViewHost_mixin
21084>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Load_InitialView
21086>>>>>>>>>        
21086>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21087>>>>>>>>>    
21087>>>>>>>>>    //  Empty stub, implemented in cWebSessionHost_mixin
21087>>>>>>>>>    Function ValidLogin Returns Boolean
21089>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True        
21090>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
