21343>>>>>>>>>    // Called as part of the initialization process before OnLoad is triggered. Gives the 
21343>>>>>>>>>    // application a chance to store the locales of the client and use them later.
21343>>>>>>>>>    //
21343>>>>>>>>>    // Params:
21343>>>>>>>>>    //      sBrowserLanguage             Language as reported by the browser (like "en-US" or "nl-NL").
21343>>>>>>>>>    //      iBrowserTimezoneOffsetMins   Timezone offset in minutes as reported by the browser. Usually 
21343>>>>>>>>>    //                                  considers daylight saving time.
21343>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnInitializeLocales String sBrowserLanguage Integer iBrowserTimezoneOffsetMins
21345>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21346>>>>>>>>>    
21346>>>>>>>>>    // Called as the last step of the initialization of the webapp just before pbInitWebApp becomes
21346>>>>>>>>>    // false. At this point the web property system should be initialized and configuration options
21346>>>>>>>>>    // (like pbLocking of phoServerPropStore) can be set here.
21346>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnPostInitialize
21348>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21349>>>>>>>>>    
21349>>>>>>>>>    // Called during the creation of the webapp object. For FlexTron this is called later to 
21349>>>>>>>>>    // synchronize better with windows controls. Note that Attach_Deo_To_Server should be broadcasted
21349>>>>>>>>>    // before this method is called.
21349>>>>>>>>>    Procedure FinishWebObjectInitialize
21351>>>>>>>>>        Broadcast Recursive Send AfterAttachDDO         // Received by all data-bound DEOs after DDO properties are applied (or not).
21353>>>>>>>>>        
21353>>>>>>>>>        Send OnPostInitialize
21354>>>>>>>>>        
21354>>>>>>>>>        // Indicate that we are finished initializing the WebApp. This comes
21354>>>>>>>>>        // after Forward Send End_Construct_Object to make sure we are fully
21354>>>>>>>>>        // protected.
21354>>>>>>>>>        Set pbInitWebApp to False
21355>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
