21422>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the collection of DDO object name and RowID pairs for the view's DDO structure.
21422>>>>>>>>>    // The collection is specially ordered so that the first DDO is the view's Main DD, followed
21422>>>>>>>>>    // by the child DDO sub-tree, then the parent DDO sub-tree. This is the order that you want
21422>>>>>>>>>    // to traverse the DDO tree when synchronizing each server DDO to the client RowIDs.
21422>>>>>>>>>    Procedure StoreDDOStates
21424>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icDDO iFile
21424>>>>>>>>>        RowID riRowID
21424>>>>>>>>>        String sCheck
21424>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamicConstraints
21424>>>>>>>>>        Integer iSrvr iSrvrs
21424>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServerDD
21424>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTable
21424>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSwitched
21424>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aDDOHandles
21425>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21425>>>>>>>>>        tWebDDODef tDDODef
21425>>>>>>>>>        
21425>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicConstraints to bDynamicConstraints
21426>>>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to tDDODef.sView
21427>>>>>>>>>        
21427>>>>>>>>>        Get paDDOHandlesTree to aDDOHandles
21428>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aDDOHandles)) to icDDO
21429>>>>>>>>>        
21429>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icDDO - 1)
21435>>>>>>>>>>
21435>>>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of aDDOHandles[i] to riRowID
21436>>>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(riRowID)) to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sRowID
21437>>>>>>>>>            Get DDIdentity aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sName
21438>>>>>>>>>            Get pDDDefaults of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aRemembered 
21439>>>>>>>>>            If (bDynamicConstraints) Begin
21441>>>>>>>>>                Get Constrain_File of aDDOHandles[i] to iFile
21442>>>>>>>>>            End
21442>>>>>>>>>>
21442>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
21443>>>>>>>>>                Move -1 to iFile
21444>>>>>>>>>            End
21444>>>>>>>>>>
21444>>>>>>>>>            Move iFile to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].iConstrainFile
21445>>>>>>>>>
21445>>>>>>>>>            // DD changed_state and parent changed state info
21445>>>>>>>>>            Get Changed_State of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].bChanged
21446>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server_Count of aDDOHandles[i] to iSrvrs
21447>>>>>>>>>            For iSrvr from 0 to (iSrvrs-1)
21453>>>>>>>>>>
21453>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Server of aDDOHandles[i] iSrvr to hoServerDD
21454>>>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iTable
21455>>>>>>>>>                Move iTable to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].iTable
21456>>>>>>>>>                Get ParentDDOSwitched of aDDOHandles[i] iTable to bSwitched
21457>>>>>>>>>                Move bSwitched to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].bSwitched 
21458>>>>>>>>>            Loop
21459>>>>>>>>>>
21459>>>>>>>>>
21459>>>>>>>>>                        
21459>>>>>>>>>        Loop
21460>>>>>>>>>>
21460>>>>>>>>>            
21460>>>>>>>>>        Move True to tDDODef.bA
21461>>>>>>>>>        
21461>>>>>>>>>        WebSet ptDDOStates to tDDODef
21462>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21463>>>>>>>>>    
21463>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NotifySyncWebApp
21465>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
