21694>>>>>>>>>    // sets all Constrain_Files starting at hoMainDD and up as based on the view stack.
21694>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EstablishConstrainFiles Handle hoMainDD tWebViewInfo[] aViewStack Handle[] ByRef hoStackDDOs RowID[] ByRef riStackRowIds
