21706>>>>>>>>>                Get FindDDOForTable aViewStack[iStack-1].iMainTable to hoParentDD
21707>>>>>>>>>                // it's possible for there to be no connection here in this view, that's ok
21707>>>>>>>>>                If hoParentDD Begin
21709>>>>>>>>>                    // keep track of all parents and their RowId
21709>>>>>>>>>                    Move (InsertInArray(hoStackDDOs,-1,hoDDO)) to hoStackDDOs
