21712>>>>>>>>>                    For iClient from 0 to (iClients-1)
21718>>>>>>>>>>
21718>>>>>>>>>                        Get Data_Set_Client of hoParentDD iClient to hoDDO
21719>>>>>>>>>                        Set Constrain_File of hoDDO to aViewStack[iStack-1].iMainTable
21720>>>>>>>>>                    Loop
21721>>>>>>>>>>
21721>>>>>>>>>                End
21721>>>>>>>>>>
21721>>>>>>>>>            End
21721>>>>>>>>>>
21721>>>>>>>>>        Loop
21722>>>>>>>>>>
