21866>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Drill-down version of the restorestate implementation. It parses the state hash into the 
21866>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // separate pieces and restores the entire view stack. It loops over the views in the state
21866>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // hash and checks if they are already properly initialized, if not it will reinitialize the
21866>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // view and rest of the stack from that point on,  if it is properly initialized it won't do
21866>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // anything for this step.
