21886>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(asMainIDs, SizeOfArray(asStates))) to asMainIDs
21887>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(asCustomStates, SizeOfArray(asStates))) to asCustomStates
21888>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(ahViews, SizeOfArray(asStates))) to ahViews
21889>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(ahInvokingObjects, SizeOfArray(asStates))) to ahInvokingObjects
21890>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(aeNavType, SizeOfArray(asStates))) to aeNavType
21891>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21891>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Start at global level
