21899>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bHandled) ;                    Procedure_Return
21902>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    
21902>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (ResizeArray(asStates, 0)) to asStates
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Parse URL and validate view names
21903>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(asStates) - 1) to iStateTo
21904>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iState from 0 to iStateTo
21910>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21910>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ParseViewStateHash asStates[iState] (&asViews[iState]) (&asMainIDs[iState]) (&asCustomStates[iState])
21911>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
