22102>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (SizeOfArray(aViewStateHashes) - 1)
22108>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22108>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (Trim(aViewStateHashes[i]) = "") Begin
22110>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (RemoveFromArray(aViewStateHashes, i)) to aViewStateHashes
22111>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
