22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Singleton object that is the central manager for all web properties handlers. It is accessed by
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the cWebApp class when needed and WebSet and WebGet are handled here. It has forwards these 
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// operations to the handler objects for the different web property types. These handlers are 
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// created by this class and all share a generic API (cWebBasePropertyHandler). These different types 
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// are Client (web properties stored and used on the client), Server (web properties stored on the 
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// server bound to the page scope) and ServerSession (web properties stored on the server bound to 
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>// the session lifetime).
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22539>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebPropertyHost_mixin is a Mixin
