22545>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoClientHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22546>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoServerHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22547>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoSessionHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22548>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoClientProtectedHandler C_WebUnresolvedObject
22549>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
22549>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitPropertyManager
22550>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
