22645>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
22645>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the cWebApp class when the processing of a request is finished. All handlers are
22645>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // triggered to store their properties and the client ahndler puts the in the passed arrays so 
22645>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // they are sent back to the client.
