22651>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler
22652>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send FinishedCall of hoHandler (&cctx.response.Header.aSyncProps) (&cctx.response.Header.aAdvSyncP)
22653>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
