22681>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End
22681>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
22681>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22681>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Now call the actual handler (now if something goes wrong it is a proper error)
22681>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Get GetScalarSyncProp of hoHandler hoObject (&pubProp) to vReturn
22682>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
22682>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function_Return vReturn
22683>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Function
