23333>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return C_WebUnresolvedObject
23334>>>>>>>>>        End
23334>>>>>>>>>>
23334>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
23335>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectByName aViewStack[iTop-1].sViewName to hoView
23336>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return hoView
23337>>>>>>>>>        End
23337>>>>>>>>>>
23337>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
