23755>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23757>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Attach_Deo_To_Server
23759>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23759>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // after DEO is attached, set the prompt button automatically (if needed)
23759>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23760>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23760>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23762>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get PromptObject to hoPrompt
23763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoPrompt <> 0) Begin
23765>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbPromptButton to True
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23766>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23767>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23767>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23767>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AfterAttachDDO
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Sent after each DEO Object has been attached to its DDO server and had all the DDO field settings
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // applied to its published properties. We will set default values to any cWebControl properties that
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // are still unassigned...
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue eDataType iPrecision
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sInputMode
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23769>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send AfterAttachDDO
23771>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23771>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Determine sInputMode
23771>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get peDataType to eDataType
23772>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psInputMode to sInputMode
23773>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eDataType = typeNumber and sInputMode = "") Begin
23775>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piPrecision to iPrecision
23776>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iPrecision > 0) Begin
23778>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "decimal"
23779>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23779>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23779>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
23780>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psInputMode to "numeric"
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Correct pbPromptButton
23781>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to iValue
23782>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23782>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
23784>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbPromptButton to False
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23785>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // On prompt button click event stub.
23786>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnPrompt
23788>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Prompt
23789>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
23790>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23790>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns PromptObject. If phoPrompt is set, it returns this, else checks with DD for web prompt object
23790>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function PromptObject Returns Handle
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt hoDD
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eStyle
23792>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebViewStyle to eStyle
23793>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eStyle = wvsDesktop or eStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
23795>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoPrompt to hoPrompt
23796>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoPrompt=0) Begin
23798>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File to iFile
23799>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Field to iField
23800>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Server to hoDD
23801>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (iFile and hoDD) Begin
23803>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get File_Field_WebPrompt_Object of hoDD iFile iField to hoPrompt
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23804>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoPrompt
23805>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns true if control supports prompt buttons and the prompt button
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default property value (not webproperty) is enabled. In general when the
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default value is false, the developer has disabled this and does not
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // want the dynamic enabling/disabling logic to be messing with it.
23806>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function HasPromptButton Returns Boolean
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bPromptButton
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // this is purposefully Get and not WebGet
23808>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbPromptButton to bPromptButton
23809>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bPromptButton
23810>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
23811>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23811>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // augmented to also remove the prompt button from
23811>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // dynamically disabled forms
23811>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicEnabled
23813>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
23813>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile eWebViewStyle
23813>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bEnabled bPrompt
23813>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23813>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
23814>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
23815>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(hoServer) or not (iFile)) Begin
23817>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
23818>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23818>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23818>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23818>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send SetDynamicEnabled
23820>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23820>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
23821>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
23823>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // note we use the design time pbPromptButton. If it is true then
23823>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // there is something to remove.
23823>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get HasPromptButton to bPrompt
23824>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bPrompt) Begin
23826>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbEnabled to bEnabled
23827>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebSet pbPromptButton to bEnabled
23828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
23828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
23828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
23828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
