24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
24122>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
24124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
24124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
24124>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
24125>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
24131>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24131>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
24132>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
24133>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
24134>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
24135>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24135>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
24136>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
24136>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // return true if this message can be delegated to an explicit server
24136>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DelegateDeoRequest Returns Boolean
24138>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoServerDEO
24138>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ServerDEO to hoServerDEO
24139>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (hoServerDEO<>0 and hoServerDEO<>Self)
24140>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
