24237>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Item_Find to hoServer eFindMode iFile iField True False False   // Entry Update = True, Show find error = True, Deferred State = False
24238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24238>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
