24924>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateItem tSelectionItem ByRef oOut String sValue Returns String
24926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound bErr
24926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
24926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoTable
24926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get RefindByValue sValue (&oOut) to bFound
24927>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bFound) ;            Function_Return True
24930>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24930>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
24931>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
24932>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
24933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get File_Field_Table_Object of hoServer iFile iField to hoTable
24934>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24934>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoTable <> 0) Begin
24936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$CannotInsertIntoValidationTable
24937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return False
24938>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24938>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24938>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
24939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Clear of hoServer
24940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoServer iField to sValue
24941>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoServer to bErr
24942>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bErr) Begin 
24944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$ErrorWhileSavingNewItem
24945>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24945>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return False
24946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
24946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoServer
24947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile))) to oOut.sRowId
24948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sValue to oOut.aValues[0]
24949>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
24949>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
24949>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
24950>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
