25033>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25033>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoSelectionSource > 0) Begin
25035>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbCaseSensitive of hoSelectionSource to bCaseSensetive            
25036>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbFullText of hoSelectionSource to bFullText
25037>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbAllData of hoSelectionSource to bAllData
25038>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbSuggestions of hoSelectionSource to bSuggestions
25039>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbPaged of hoSelectionSource to bPaged
25040>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
