25041>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbUseValidationTable of hoSelectionSource to bIsValidationTable
25042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbSourceIsValidationTable to bIsValidationTable
25043>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25043>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ValidateSuggestionMode bAllData bSuggestions bPaged
25044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbAllData to bAllData
25045>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbSuggestions to bSuggestions
25046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbPaged to bPaged
25047>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbCaseSensitive to bCaseSensetive
25048>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25048>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
