25062>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Case Begin
25062>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (sRowId = C_WebBaseSelectionForm_More_Control) 
25064>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send FindSuggestions sValue iPage iAdditionalItems
25065>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
25066>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (sRowId = C_WebBaseSelectionForm_CreateNew_Control) 
25069>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send CreateNewByValue sValue
25070>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
25071>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (sRowId = C_WebBaseSelectionForm_AdvancedSearch_Control)
