25157>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move True to tCustomItem.bServer
25158>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sRowId to tCustomItem.sRowId
25159>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sText to tCustomItem.aValues[0]
25160>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "Sugg_ControlSuggestion" to tCustomItem.sCssClassName 
25161>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tCustomItem to aItems[-1]
25162>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
