26322>>>>>>>>>>>        Move True to FilterState.bDisregardFilter
26323>>>>>>>>>>>        Move FilterState to vFilterState
26324>>>>>>>>>>>
26324>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Rebuild_Constraints of hoDD
26325>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
