26620>>>>>>>>>//    
26620>>>>>>>>>//    // Returns the table's status for the refresh event. A table can either be
26620>>>>>>>>>//    // cleared, found or not touched by the operation. This can only be called while
26620>>>>>>>>>//    // within Refresh. This was created to hide the private is_file_included command
26620>>>>>>>>>//    { Visibility=Private }
26620>>>>>>>>>//    Function DDRefreshTableStatus Integer iTable Returns Integer
