27307>>>>>>>>>            Move iColumnIndex to aParams[0]    
27308>>>>>>>>>        
27308>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "scrollToCol" aParams
27309>>>>>>>>>        End
27309>>>>>>>>>>
27309>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
27310>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Invalid column handle!"
27311>>>>>>>>>>
27311>>>>>>>>>        End
