27321>>>>>>>>>        
27321>>>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
27322>>>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to aData
27323>>>>>>>>>        
27323>>>>>>>>>        Send OnProcessDataSet aData eOperation iSelectedRowIndex
27324>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
