27325>>>>>>>>>    // was working on. Implement this event to store all the grid data at once. Use the ProcessDataSet
27325>>>>>>>>>    // method to trigger this event.
27325>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnProcessDataSet tWebRow[] aData Integer eOperation Integer iSelectedRowIndex
27327>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
