28001>>>>>>>    // Is the view changed? 
28001>>>>>>>    // Currently we just look at should_save of the main ddo. We
28001>>>>>>>    // might want to expand this to look for changed children 
28001>>>>>>>    Function IsViewChanged Returns Boolean
28003>>>>>>>        Handle hoMain
28003>>>>>>>        Boolean bShouldSave
28003>>>>>>>        Get Main_DD to hoMain
28004>>>>>>>        
28004>>>>>>>        If (hoMain) Begin
28006>>>>>>>            Get Should_Save of hoMain to bShouldSave
28007>>>>>>>        End
28007>>>>>>>>
28007>>>>>>>        Function_Return bShouldSave
