28009>>>>>>>    // returns true if this should use dynamic constraints. By default
28009>>>>>>>    // desktop views never use this and probably never should.
28009>>>>>>>    // Drilldown views do use this but there may be times you'd want to stop this
28009>>>>>>>    // in which case you's set pbDrillDownDynamicConstraints to true. 
28009>>>>>>>    Function IsDynamicConstraints Returns Boolean
28011>>>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
28011>>>>>>>        Boolean bDynamicConstraints
28011>>>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
28012>>>>>>>        Get pbDrillDownDynamicConstraints to bDynamicConstraints
28013>>>>>>>        Function_Return (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown and bDynamicConstraints)
28014>>>>>>>    End_Function
