29079>>>>>>>    Function GenerateStateHash Returns String
29081>>>>>>>        Integer eViewStyle
29081>>>>>>>        String sResult
29081>>>>>>>        
29081>>>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eViewStyle
29082>>>>>>>        If (eViewStyle = wvsDesktop) Begin
29084>>>>>>>            Get GenerateStateHash_Desktop to sResult    
29085>>>>>>>        End
