29136>>>>>>>    // You would typically use this event when a view is re-used in 
29136>>>>>>>    // different contexts within your application and you would like 
29136>>>>>>>    // to modify the appearance and features of the view accordingly.
29136>>>>>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Handle hoInvokingView Handle hoInvokingObject
29138>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
