29139>>>>>>>    // Callback handler for the Show function used when navigating into a desktop view with the 
29139>>>>>>>    // drilldown model. It adds the view to the stack, now that we know for sure that it is in sync.
29139>>>>>>>    Procedure Show_CallBack Handle hoView
29141>>>>>>>        Send PushView to (ViewStack(Self)) hoView nfUndefined
29142>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
29143>>>>>>>
29143>>>>>>>    // This is overridden to handle desktop and drill down views.
29143>>>>>>>    // 1. if this is a dialog or if there is no stack, it just does a normal show
29143>>>>>>>    // dfirst Clear the view stack down as far as the default
29143>>>>>>>    // view, then load this view.
29143>>>>>>>    //
29143>>>>>>>    // Note: Augmenting this here means two things:
29143>>>>>>>    // 1. The application already supports the View Stack (drill-down)
29143>>>>>>>    // 2. That the Show command in the superclass does -not- try to manipulate the view stack.  
29143>>>>>>>    Procedure Show
29145>>>>>>>        Handle hoDefaultView hoTopView
29145>>>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
29145>>>>>>>        Boolean bOK bUnconditional
29145>>>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
29146>>>>>>>        If ((ViewStack(Self))=0 or eWebViewStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
29148>>>>>>>            Forward Send Show
29150>>>>>>>        End
29150>>>>>>>>
29150>>>>>>>        Else If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDesktop) Begin
29153>>>>>>>            Get GetDefaultView to hoDefaultView
29154>>>>>>>            Get TopViewHandle of (ViewStack(Self)) to hoTopView
29155>>>>>>>            Move (hoTopView=0 or peWebViewStyle(hoTopView)=wvsDesktop) to bUnconditional
29156>>>>>>>            Get Reset of (ViewStack(Self)) True bUnconditional to bOK
29157>>>>>>>            If bOK Begin
29159>>>>>>>                // if a non-drilldown just show and add to view stack
29159>>>>>>>                Send SetInvokingObject 0
29160>>>>>>>                Send ShowView to (Host(Self)) Self (RefProc(Show_CallBack)) Self
29161>>>>>>>            End
29161>>>>>>>>
29161>>>>>>>        End
29161>>>>>>>>
29161>>>>>>>        // moving to a drill down view - same as NavigateBegin
29161>>>>>>>        Else Begin
29162>>>>>>>            Send NavigatePathBegin Self False
29163>>>>>>>        End
29163>>>>>>>>
29163>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
29164>>>>>>>
29164>>>>>>>
29164>>>>>>>    // Send this to update psInvokingView of this view to the name of the next view down
29164>>>>>>>    // in the view stack. Also, psInvokingView of this next view down is set to "".
29164>>>>>>>    // This ensures that Only to top view in the view stack and its invoking view are synchronized.
29164>>>>>>>    // The view that receives this message should be the top view in the view stack. 
29164>>>>>>>    Procedure UpdateInvokingViewDrillDownStyle
29166>>>>>>>        Handle hoInvokingView
29166>>>>>>>        String sInvokingView
29166>>>>>>>        
29166>>>>>>>        Get InvokingViewHandle of (ViewStack(Self)) to hoInvokingView
29167>>>>>>>        
29167>>>>>>>        If (hoInvokingView = 0) Begin
29169>>>>>>>            Move "" to sInvokingView
29170>>>>>>>        End
29170>>>>>>>>
29170>>>>>>>        Else Begin
29171>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectName of hoInvokingView to sInvokingView
29172>>>>>>>            WebSet psInvokingView of hoInvokingView to ""
29173>>>>>>>        End
29173>>>>>>>>
29173>>>>>>>        
29173>>>>>>>        WebSet psInvokingView to sInvokingView
29174>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
