30460>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Generates random data.
30460>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GenerateRandom Integer iBytes Returns UChar[]
30462>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hProv
30462>>>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] uaResult
30463>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRes
30463>>>>>>>>>>>        
30463>>>>>>>>>>>        Get AcquireContext to hProv
30464>>>>>>>>>>>        
30464>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(uaResult, iBytes)) to uaResult
30465>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (CryptGenRandom(hProv, iBytes, AddressOf(uaResult))) to bRes
30466>>>>>>>>>>>        
30466>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ReleaseContext hProv to bRes
30467>>>>>>>>>>>        
30467>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return uaResult
30468>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
