30510>>>>>>>>>    // User hook to manage what to do when creating a new client/server session. By default
30510>>>>>>>>>    // the system will create a globally unique identifier GUID as a new session key.
30510>>>>>>>>>    // This is called automatically during LoadWebApp and the session key is passed back to the 
30510>>>>>>>>>    // client.
30510>>>>>>>>>    // sRemoteAddress - Is the IP address of the client.
30510>>>>>>>>>    // Returns        - The new session key.
30510>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateSession String sRemoteAddress Returns String
30512>>>>>>>>>        String sSessionKey
30512>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoCryptRandom
30512>>>>>>>>>        Integer iLength
30512>>>>>>>>>        
30512>>>>>>>>>        Get piSessionKeyLength to iLength
30513>>>>>>>>>        
30513>>>>>>>>>        //  Generate a random key (slightly too long)
30513>>>>>>>>>        Get phoRandomizer to hoCryptRandom
30514>>>>>>>>>        Get GenerateRandomString of hoCryptRandom (iLength + 10) to sSessionKey
30515>>>>>>>>>        
30515>>>>>>>>>        //  Clear out special characters as these might cause issues with older browsers and ASP Classic, and then cut to the proper length
30515>>>>>>>>>        Move (Left(Replaces("+", Replaces("/", sSessionKey, ""), ""), iLength)) to sSessionKey
30516>>>>>>>>>        
30516>>>>>>>>>        Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
30517>>>>>>>>>        
30517>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sSessionKey
30518>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
