30794>>>>>>>    // Returns the full file path of the standard Reportcache target folder of the current workspace.
30794>>>>>>>    // Normally this would be "<home>\Reports\Cache" where <home> is the full path to the workspace's
30794>>>>>>>    // root folder.
30794>>>>>>>    //
