30800>>>>>>>            Move (Left(sHome, Length(sHome)-1)) to sHome
30801>>>>>>>        End
30801>>>>>>>>
30801>>>>>>>
30801>>>>>>>        Move (sHome - sSep - "Reports" - sSep - "Cache") to sPath    // i.e. sPath = "<home>\Reports\Cache"
30802>>>>>>>        Move (GetFileAttributes(sPath)) to iAttributes
30803>>>>>>>
