31680>>>>>>>>>    //
31680>>>>>>>>>    // Enumerate all errors.
31680>>>>>>>>>    // For each error send iMsg to hObj passing all required error
31680>>>>>>>>>    // information: iErr#, sErrorMsg, iLine, iFile, iField
31680>>>>>>>>>    //
31680>>>>>>>>>    Procedure EnumerateErrors Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31682>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
31682>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31683>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iCount
31684>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to iCount
31690>>>>>>>>>>
31690>>>>>>>>>            Send ErrorReportCallback i iMsg hObj
31691>>>>>>>>>        Loop
31692>>>>>>>>>>
31692>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31693>>>>>>>>>    
31693>>>>>>>>>    // if item is -1 it is last error
31693>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ErrorReportCallback Integer iItem Integer iMsg Integer hObj
31695>>>>>>>>>        String  sErrMsg
31695>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFileNr iFieldNr iErrNr iLineNr
31695>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31695>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31696>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31699>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31701>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrNr   iItem to iErrNr
31702>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_ErrMsg  iItem to sErrMsg
31703>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_LineNr  iItem to iLineNr
31704>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FileNr  iItem to iFileNr
31705>>>>>>>>>            Get Error_FieldNr iItem to iFieldNr
31706>>>>>>>>>            Send iMsg to hObj iErrNr sErrMsg iLineNr iFileNr iFieldNr
31707>>>>>>>>>        End
31707>>>>>>>>>>
31707>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31708>>>>>>>>>    
31708>>>>>>>>>    // this is used to remove a single error from the queue
31708>>>>>>>>>    // if iItem is -1, last error
31708>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClearError Integer iItem
31710>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount
31710>>>>>>>>>        Get ErrorCount to iCount
31711>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31714>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) Begin
31716>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item iItem
31717>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oErrorText iItem
31718>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oLineNr    iItem
31719>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFileNr    iItem
31720>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Item to oFieldNr   iItem
31721>>>>>>>>>        End
31721>>>>>>>>>>
31721>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
31722>>>>>>>>>    
