31725>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem=-1) ;            Move (iCount-1) to iItem // if -1, use last error
31728>>>>>>>>>        If (iItem>=0 and iCount>iItem) ;            Get Error_ErrMsg iItem to sErrMsg
31731>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sErrMsg
