32238>>>>>>>>>    
32238>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
32240>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
32242>>>>>>>>>        
32242>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peSortItems csUnsorted     // Determines the sort order of the combo items. Note that changes to this property value at runtime only apply when refilling the combo.
32245>>>>>>>>>
32245>>>>>>>>>        Property RowID[] private_paRowIDs
32246>>>>>>>>>        Property tWebComboItem[] paComboItems
32247>>>>>>>>>        
32247>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbAddEmptyItem True
32248>>>>>>>>>        Property String psEmptyItemDescription ""
32249>>>>>>>>>        
32249>>>>>>>>>        Set psJSClass to "df.WebCombo"
