32553>>>>>>>>>        String sVal sLowSearch
32553>>>>>>>>>        
32553>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
32554>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
32555>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
32556>>>>>>>>>        
32556>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
32558>>>>>>>>>            WebGet piMaxResults to iMax
32559>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbCaseSensitive to bCase
32560>>>>>>>>>            
32560>>>>>>>>>            Get piFindIndex to iIndex
32561>>>>>>>>>            If (iIndex <= 0) Begin
32563>>>>>>>>>                Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_INDEX of iFile iField to iIndex
32566>>>>>>>>>            End
32566>>>>>>>>>>
32566>>>>>>>>>            
32566>>>>>>>>>            Get No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32567>>>>>>>>>            Get DDOConstraintNeedsRelate of hoServer iIndex to bNeedsRelate
32568>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to (not(bNeedsRelate))
32569>>>>>>>>>            
32569>>>>>>>>>            
32569>>>>>>>>>            Move (Lowercase(sSearch)) to sLowSearch
32570>>>>>>>>>            Move True to bContinue
32571>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to iRow
32572>>>>>>>>>                
32572>>>>>>>>>            //  Find first record
32572>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Read of hoServer FIRST_RECORD iFile iIndex
32573>>>>>>>>>            
32573>>>>>>>>>            While (Found and (iRow < iMax))
32577>>>>>>>>>                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sVal
32580>>>>>>>>>                
32580>>>>>>>>>                If ((bCase and sVal contains sSearch) or (not(bCase) and Lowercase(sVal) contains sLowSearch) or sSearch = "") Begin
32582>>>>>>>>>                    Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile)))  to aSuggestions[iRow].sRowId
32583>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(sVal))                       to aSuggestions[iRow].aValues[0]
32584>>>>>>>>>                    Increment iRow
32585>>>>>>>>>                End
32585>>>>>>>>>>
32585>>>>>>>>>                
32585>>>>>>>>>                Send Request_Read of hoServer GT iFile iIndex 
32586>>>>>>>>>            Loop
32587>>>>>>>>>>
32587>>>>>>>>>            Set No_Relate_State of hoServer to bOldRelate
32588>>>>>>>>>        End
32588>>>>>>>>>>
