32705>>>>>>>>>                    End
32705>>>>>>>>>>
32705>>>>>>>>>                End
32705>>>>>>>>>>
32705>>>>>>>>>            End
32705>>>>>>>>>>
32705>>>>>>>>>            Else If (iMode = smValidationTable) Begin
32708>>>>>>>>>                Send SuggestionsValidation sSearch (&aSuggestions) bFullText
32709>>>>>>>>>            End
32709>>>>>>>>>>
32709>>>>>>>>>        End
32709>>>>>>>>>>
32709>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
