33256>>>>>>>    
33256>>>>>>>    // Event that is triggered when the user performs a clear on a grid or tries to change rows 
33256>>>>>>>    // with pbAutoSave set to false. Implement this event to perform a custom clear action. To do 
33256>>>>>>>    // this the psValue and pbChanged properties of the column objects can be set. Return false to 
33256>>>>>>>    // stop the default clear action.
