33258>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
33259>>>>>>>    End_Function        
33260>>>>>>>
33260>>>>>>>    // This event is triggered by Request_Save. Augment this event to manually save the current 
33260>>>>>>>    // grid. The rowid of the current row is passed and psValue and pbChanged can be queried on the
33260>>>>>>>    // column objects to fetch current values. Manipulating those properties will update the 
33260>>>>>>>    // displayed record on the client. Returning false will cancel the default save action when 
33260>>>>>>>    // pbDataAware is true. When saving a new row the sCurrentRowID can be changed to update the 
33260>>>>>>>    // rowid of the newly created record.
33260>>>>>>>    //
33260>>>>>>>    // Note that this event is not triggered on a row change when pbOfflineEditing is set to True. 
33260>>>>>>>    Function OnSaveRow String ByRef sCurrentRowID Returns Boolean
33262>>>>>>>       Function_Return True 
33263>>>>>>>    End_Function
