33264>>>>>>>    // last row. It can be implemented to manipulate the initial values of the new row. This can be
33264>>>>>>>    // done by updating the psValue properties of the grid columns.
33264>>>>>>>    // 
33264>>>>>>>    // Note that this event is not called when pbofflineEditing is set to True.
33264>>>>>>>    Procedure OnNewRow
