33691>>>>>>>    Procedure privateOnSelectEvent Integer iEvent
33693>>>>>>>        tWebRow Row
33693>>>>>>>        tWebRow Row
33693>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
33693>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
33694>>>>>>>        Case Begin
33694>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 1) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_SINGLE
33696>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33697>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectRow Row
33698>>>>>>>                Case Break
33699>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 2) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_SINGLE
33702>>>>>>>                Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to Row
33703>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectRow Row
33704>>>>>>>                Case Break
33705>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 3) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_SELECT_ALL
33708>>>>>>>                WebSet pbAllSelected to True
33709>>>>>>>                Send OnSelectAllRows
33710>>>>>>>                Case Break
33711>>>>>>>            Case (iEvent = 4) // C_WEBLIST_MULTI_DESELECT_ALL
33714>>>>>>>                WebSet pbAllSelected to False
33715>>>>>>>                Send OnDeSelectAllRows
33716>>>>>>>                Case Break
33717>>>>>>>        Case End
33717>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
