33827>>>>>>>        Boolean bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33827>>>>>>>        Get pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33828>>>>>>>        
33828>>>>>>>        Set pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to False
33829>>>>>>>        Forward Send OnSearch sSearchText
33831>>>>>>>        Set pbPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh to bPrivateClearSelectionOnRefresh
33832>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
