34069>>>>>>>    Procedure SetMenuViewAccess Boolean bAllowAccess
34071>>>>>>>        // used to handle access view menus. By default it disables items where access is not allowed. Depending
34071>>>>>>>        // on the value of pbHideViewWhenNoAccess this will either enable or render menu items. If you need to
34071>>>>>>>        // do other things, augment OnChangeRights
34071>>>>>>>        Boolean bEnabled bHideViewWhenNoAccess
34071>>>>>>>
