34710>>>>>>>    // error but to default to a different mode such as umPromptValue, just remove the error and
34710>>>>>>>    // set peUpdateMode.
34710>>>>>>>    Procedure OnRelationalPromptListError
34712>>>>>>>        Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$PromptListCannotbeRelational
34713>>>>>>>>
