35523>>>>>>>        If (not(AppSynching(Host(Self)))) Begin
35525>>>>>>>            Get Server to hoServer
35526>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
35527>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
35528>>>>>>>            
35528>>>>>>>            If (hoServer > 0 and iFile > 0) Begin
35530>>>>>>>                //  Do security check
35530>>>>>>>                If (not(FillDEOAllowed(Self))) Begin
35532>>>>>>>                    Procedure_Return
35533>>>>>>>                End
35533>>>>>>>>
35533>>>>>>>                
35533>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
35534>>>>>>>                
