38105>>>>>>>        tWebDrawingEventData eventData
38105>>>>>>>
38105>>>>>>>        Get phoActionJsonData to hoJson
38106>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoJson to eventData
38107>>>>>>>        
38107>>>>>>>        Case Begin
38107>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseClick")
38109>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseClick sId eventData
38110>>>>>>>                Case Break
38111>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDoubleClick")
38114>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDoubleClick sId eventData
38115>>>>>>>                Case Break
38116>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseUp")
38119>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseUp sId eventData
38120>>>>>>>                Case Break
38121>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDown")
38124>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDown sId eventData
38125>>>>>>>                Case Break
38126>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseDrag")
38129>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseDrag sId eventData
38130>>>>>>>                Case Break
38131>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseEnter")
38134>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseEnter sId eventData
38135>>>>>>>                Case Break
38136>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseLeave")
38139>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
38140>>>>>>>                Case Break
38141>>>>>>>            Case (sEventName = "HandleMouseMove")
38144>>>>>>>                Send OnMouseMove sId eventData
38145>>>>>>>                Case Break
38146>>>>>>>        Case End
38146>>>>>>>        
38146>>>>>>>        Send UpdateDrawing
38147>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
