38768>>>>>>>Class cPasswordHasher is a cObject
38769>>>>>>>    
38769>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol cPasswordHasher_Mixin
38770>>>>>>>    
38770>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
38772>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
38774>>>>>>>        
38774>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   peAlgorithm         C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512 
38775>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   puiSaltSize         16
38776>>>>>>>        
38776>>>>>>>        Property UInteger   puiOptTimeCost      420000
38777>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
38778>>>>>>>    
38778>>>>>>>    Function CreatePasswordHash String sPassword String ByRef sHash Returns Boolean
38780>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
38780>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
38780>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
38781>>>>>>>        
38781>>>>>>>        Case Begin
38781>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
38783>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
38786>>>>>>>                Get CreatePasswordHashEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) sPassword (&sHash) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to bOk
38787>>>>>>>                Case Break
38788>>>>>>>            Case Else
38788>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
38789>>>>>>>>
38789>>>>>>>                Function_Return False
38790>>>>>>>        Case End
38790>>>>>>>        
38790>>>>>>>        Function_Return bOk
38791>>>>>>>    End_Function
38792>>>>>>>    
38792>>>>>>>    Function RequiredBufferSize Returns UBigInt
38794>>>>>>>        UBigInt ullSize
38794>>>>>>>        UInteger uiAlgo
38794>>>>>>>        Get peAlgorithm to uiAlgo
38795>>>>>>>        
38795>>>>>>>        Case Begin
38795>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_256)
38797>>>>>>>            Case (uiAlgo = C_PWH_PBKDF2_HMAC_SHA_512)
38800>>>>>>>                Get RequiredBufferSizeEx uiAlgo (puiSaltSize(Self)) (puiOptTimeCost(Self)) to ullSize
38801>>>>>>>                Case Break
38802>>>>>>>            Case Else
38802>>>>>>>                Error 8710 "Invalid algorithm selected."
38803>>>>>>>>
38803>>>>>>>                Function_Return 0
38804>>>>>>>        Case End
38804>>>>>>>        
38804>>>>>>>        Function_Return ullSize
38805>>>>>>>    End_Function
38806>>>>>>>
38806>>>>>>>End_Class
