39076>>>>>    
39076>>>>>    //
39076>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
39076>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
39076>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
39076>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
39076>>>>>    //
39076>>>>>    // Params:
39076>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
39076>>>>>    //
39076>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
39078>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
39078>>>>>        
39078>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
39079>>>>>        
39079>>>>>        //  Update user properties
39079>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
39081>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
39082>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
39083>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
39084>>>>>            
39084>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
39085>>>>>        End
39085>>>>>>
39085>>>>>        Else Begin
39086>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
39087>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
39088>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
39089>>>>>            
39089>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
39090>>>>>        End
39090>>>>>>
39090>>>>>    End_Procedure
39091>>>>>    
39091>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
39093>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
39093>>>>>    End_Procedure
39094>>>>>    
39094>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
39096>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
39096>>>>>    End_Procedure
39097>>>>>    
39097>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
39099>>>>>        Integer iErr
