39099>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
39099>>>>>        
39099>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
39100>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
39101>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
39103>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
39105>>>>>            Procedure_Return
39106>>>>>        End
39106>>>>>>
39106>>>>>            
39106>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
39106>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
39107>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
39108>>>>>        
39108>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
39109>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
39111>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
39112>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
39113>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
39115>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
39115>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
39116>>>>>>
39116>>>>>                Procedure_Return
39117>>>>>            End
39117>>>>>>
39117>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
39118>>>>>        End
39118>>>>>>
39118>>>>>    End_Procedure
