39500>>>>>            Get psEncryptPassword of (Host(Self)) to sEncryptPassword
39501>>>>>            Get Decrypt of oDataCrypter (StringToUCharArray(sEncryptPassword)) ucBinary to ucPlainKey
39502>>>>>        End
39502>>>>>>
39502>>>>>        
